#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-alert` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — An inline message with a status colour bar and a masked status glyph from the shared icon set."
msgstr "`.instui-alert` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Mesej sebaris dengan bar warna status dan glif status berkedap daripada set ikon kongsi."

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A custom `-icon-<name>` swaps the status glyph but keeps the variant's coloured bar; the bar fill is re-asserted at higher specificity so the shared icon painter doesn't consume it. A direct close button defaults to small; add a size modifier to override it."
msgstr "Satu `-icon-<name>` tersuai menukar glif status tetapi mengekalkan bar berwarna varian; isian bar ditegaskan semula pada spesifiti yang lebih tinggi supaya pelukis ikon kongsi tidak menggunakannya. Butang tutup terus lalai kepada saiz kecil; tambah pengubah saiz untuk menidakkan."

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [alert.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/alert/alert.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [alert.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/alert/alert.css)"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "JS Enhancement"
msgstr "Peningkatan JS"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component's CSS renders and works on its own; pair it with `@pantoken/interactions` to add the interactive behavior. Its `-timeout` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "CSS komponen ini dirender dan berfungsi sendiri; padankan dengan `@pantoken/interactions` untuk menambah tingkah laku interaktif. Pengubah `-timeout` dipacu oleh tingkah laku itu. Lihat [jadual pengubah di bawah](#modifiers)."

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Accessibility"
msgstr "## Aksesibiliti"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
