msgstr "Latar dan sapuan ikon berwarna laut."

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Violet-tinted background and icon swatch."
msgstr "Latar dan sapuan ikon berwarna ungu."

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Swap the default `info` glyph for an icon from the shared icon set (for example, `-icon-megaphone`)."
msgstr "Tukar glif lalai `info` kepada ikon dari set ikon kongsi (contohnya, `-icon-megaphone`)."

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter padding and gap."
msgstr "Padding dan jurang lebih ketat."

