msgstr "Sederhana (lalai). @affects breadcrumb.link — Menyesuaikan jarak pemisah remah supaya sepadan."

#: css/breadcrumb.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). @affects breadcrumb.link — Scales the crumb separator's spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "Sederhana (lalai). @affects breadcrumb.link — Menyesuaikan jarak pemisah remah supaya sepadan. Alias bentuk panjang bagi `-size-md`."

#: css/breadcrumb.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small. @affects breadcrumb.link — Scales the crumb separator's spacing to match."
msgstr "Kecil. @affects breadcrumb.link — Menyesuaikan jarak pemisah remah supaya sepadan."

#: css/breadcrumb.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small. @affects breadcrumb.link — Scales the crumb separator's spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Kecil. @affects breadcrumb.link — Menyesuaikan jarak pemisah remah supaya sepadan. Alias bentuk panjang bagi `-size-sm`."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: button"
msgstr ""

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-button` — An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "`.instui-button` — Kawalan tindakan boleh diakses, bergaya daripada palet token; utama secara lalai."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI variants layer two gradients — a padding-box fill and a border-box stroke — for their frame, and `-color-ai-secondary` can't paint gradient text and a fill at once, so its centre stays transparent at rest and fills on hover or active. `-without-background` hover and active derive a low-opacity, slightly-darkened brand wash rather than using the raw hover-background tokens, which would print same-colour-on-same-colour text. Also sets its own icon/label `gap` and horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. The optional `.instui-button-group` wrapper maps Figma's `.buttonGroup` and owns adjacent button spacing."
msgstr "Varian AI melapisi dua gradien — isian padding-box dan goresan border-box — untuk rangkanya, dan `-color-ai-secondary` tidak boleh mengecat teks bergredien dan isian serentak, jadi tengahnya kekal telus dalam keadaan rehat dan terisi semasa hover atau aktif. Hover dan aktif `-without-background` menghasilkan sapuan jenama yang sedikit gelap dengan kelegapan rendah daripada menggunakan token latar-hover mentah, yang akan mencetak teks warna-sama-atas-warna-sama. Juga menetapkan sendiri `gap` ikon/label dan `padding` mendatar; merangkai utiliti jarak `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` menggantikan nilai terbina itu. Pembalut pilihan `.instui-button-group` memetakan `.buttonGroup` Figma dan memiliki jarak butang bersebelahan."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drive the `-toggle` variant's pressed state with `aria-pressed`, and mark a disabled button with `aria-disabled` (or the native `disabled`)."
msgstr "Kendalikan keadaan ditekan varian `-toggle` dengan `aria-pressed`, dan tandakan butang yang dilumpuhkan dengan `aria-disabled` (atau `disabled` asli)."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A group wrapper lays out adjacent buttons with the shared button gap."
msgstr "Pembalut kumpulan menyusun butang bersebelahan dengan jurang butang yang dikongsi."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An AI action."
msgstr "Tindakan AI."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
