#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: callout"
msgstr ""

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-callout\"]` — Inline information alert for a short reminder or note."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-callout\"]` — Amaran maklumat sebaris untuk peringatan atau nota ringkas."

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Callout when:"
msgstr "✅ Gunakan Callout apabila:"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need to highlight important information or reminders inline\n- The message is relatively brief (a sentence to a short paragraph)\n- The alert should draw attention without interrupting the main flow\n🚫 Don't use Callout when:"
msgstr "- Anda perlu menyerlahkan maklumat penting atau peringatan secara sebaris\n- Mesej agak ringkas (satu ayat hingga perenggan pendek)\n- Amaran harus menarik perhatian tanpa mengganggu aliran utama\n🚫 Jangan gunakan Callout apabila:"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The message requires interaction or multiple actions — use a Modal or Alert Dialog\n- The content is the main focus of the page — use a Card or Hero layout instead"
msgstr "- Mesej memerlukan interaksi atau berbilang tindakan — gunakan Modal atau Alert Dialog\n- Kandungan adalah tumpuan utama halaman — gunakan Card atau susunan Hero sebaliknya"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure the alert role is properly applied (role=\"alert\" or role=\"status\")\n- Use semantic color contrast that meets WCAG AA standards\n- Don't rely on color alone to convey meaning"
msgstr "- Pastikan peranan amaran diterapkan dengan betul (role=\"alert\" atau role=\"status\")\n- Gunakan kontras warna semantik yang memenuhi piawaian WCAG AA\n- Jangan bergantung pada warna sahaja untuk menyampaikan makna"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alert message content"
msgstr "Kandungan mesej amaran"

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for the text content."
msgstr "Bekas untuk kandungan teks."

#: css/callout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional icon to the left of the content."
msgstr "Ikon pilihan di sebelah kiri kandungan."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: card"
msgstr ""

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-card` — A surface container that accepts arbitrary content."
msgstr "`.instui-card` — Bekas permukaan yang menerima kandungan sewenang-wenangnya."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Variant** controls how direct children are styled: `content` (default) leaves them\n  unstyled; `container` stacks them as bordered, padded sections. Padding scales with\n  viewport width and is the same across both variants.\n  **Size** is fully responsive — padding and border-radius step up automatically at 320px\n  (20rem) and 640px (40rem) via standard `min-width` media queries; no size class is needed.\n  Pair with `@pantoken/components` for heading, button, and other inline components."
msgstr "**Variant** mengawal bagaimana anak terusannya distailkan: `content` (lalai) meninggalkan mereka\n  tanpa gaya; `container` menyusunnya sebagai bahagian berbingkai dan berpadding. Padding berskala mengikut\n  lebar paparan dan adalah sama bagi kedua-dua varian.\n  **Size** adalah sepenuhnya responsif — padding dan jejari sempadan meningkat secara automatik pada 320px\n  (20rem) dan 640px (40rem) melalui kueri media `min-width` standard; tiada kelas saiz diperlukan.\n  Padankan dengan `@pantoken/components` untuk tajuk, butang, dan komponen baris lain."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Use `<article>` as the card element when the card is a self-contained unit of content;\n  use `<section>` when grouped within a larger landmark. In `-variant-container`, prefer\n  `<section>` elements as direct children so each bordered region carries semantic meaning."
msgstr "Gunakan `<article>` sebagai elemen kad apabila kad adalah unit kandungan yang berdiri sendiri;\n  gunakan `<section>` apabila digolongkan dalam tanda tempat (landmark) yang lebih besar. Dalam `-variant-container`, utamakan\n  elemen `<section>` sebagai anak terus supaya setiap kawasan berbingkai membawa makna semantik."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Content card -nocard"
msgstr "Kad kandungan -nocard"

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container card -nocard"
msgstr "Kad bekas -nocard"

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container card; direct children become bordered, padded sections."
msgstr "Kad bekas; anak terus menjadi bahagian berbingkai dan berpadding."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standard content card; children are unstyled. Default when no variant is set."
msgstr "Kad kandungan standard; anak-anak tidak distailkan. Lalai apabila tiada varian ditetapkan."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `@scope` is Baseline 2023 Newly Available; the card degrades to an unscoped flat stylesheet\n  in older browsers with no loss of visible styling."
msgstr "- `@scope` adalah Baseline 2023 Baru Tersedia; kad akan merosot kepada helaian gaya rata tanpa julat\n  dalam pelayar lama tanpa kehilangan gaya yang kelihatan."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [heading](/api/css/heading.md) — Place directly in the card or inside a container section.\n- [button](/api/css/button.md) — Place directly in the card or inside a container section.\n- [img](/api/css/img.md) — Place directly in the card as a media region.\n- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — Place directly in the card as a status indicator."
msgstr "- [heading](/api/css/heading.md) — Letakkan terus dalam kad atau di dalam seksyen bekas.\n- [button](/api/css/button.md) — Letakkan terus dalam kad atau di dalam seksyen bekas.\n- [img](/api/css/img.md) — Letakkan terus dalam kad sebagai kawasan media.\n- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — Letakkan terus dalam kad sebagai penunjuk status."

#: css/card.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- https://drafts.csswg.org/css-cascade-6/#scoping"
msgstr "- https://drafts.csswg.org/css-cascade-6/#scoping"

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: checkbox"
msgstr ""

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-checkbox` — A native checkbox and its label, or a switch via `-variant-toggle`."
msgstr "`.instui-checkbox` — Kotak semak asli dan labelnya, atau suis melalui `-variant-toggle`."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set `el.indeterminate = true` in JavaScript to show the mixed-state dash; the checked tick auto-contrasts against the fill — white on a dark fill, near-black on a light one. Also sets its own `gap` between the control and its label; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Tetapkan `el.indeterminate = true` dalam JavaScript untuk menunjukkan palang keadaan bercampur; tanda semak yang ditanda akan mengkontraskan secara automatik terhadap isian — putih pada isian gelap, hampir hitam pada isian terang. Juga menetapkan `gap` sendiri antara kawalan dan labelnya; merangkaian dengan pengubah utiliti jarak `-gap-*` akan menggantikan nilai terbina itu."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [checkbox.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/checkbox/checkbox.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [checkbox.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/checkbox/checkbox.css)"

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native `<input type=\"checkbox\">` drives `:checked`, `:indeterminate`, and `:disabled`; set `el.indeterminate = true` in JavaScript for the mixed state, and note that `-readonly` is styling only since checkboxes have no native readonly attribute."
msgstr "`<input type=\"checkbox\">` asli mengawal `:checked`, `:indeterminate`, dan `:disabled`; tetapkan `el.indeterminate = true` dalam JavaScript untuk keadaan bercampur, dan ambil perhatian bahawa `-readonly` hanya untuk penggayaan kerana kotak semak tidak mempunyai atribut readonly asli."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Invalid (error) state."
msgstr "Keadaan tidak sah (ralat)."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the label after the control."
msgstr "Letakkan label selepas kawalan."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the label before the control."
msgstr "Letakkan label sebelum kawalan."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the label above the control."
msgstr "Letakkan label di atas kawalan."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read-only state."
msgstr "Keadaan baca-sahaja."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Show the required-field asterisk next to the label."
msgstr "Tunjukkan asterisk medan wajib di sebelah label."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render as a switch instead of a box."
msgstr "Paparkan sebagai suis dan bukannya kotak."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The required-field asterisk."
msgstr "Asterisk medan wajib."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On `-variant-toggle`, the state glyph riding the handle: an X when off, a check when on."
msgstr "Pada `-variant-toggle`, glif keadaan yang menempati pemegang: X apabila mati, tanda semak apabila hidup."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The masked tick or dash glyph centered in the box; on `-variant-toggle` it becomes the sliding handle instead."
msgstr "Glif tanda semak atau palang yang dimaskkan terletak di tengah kotak; pada `-variant-toggle` ia menjadi pemegang gelangsar sebaliknya."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The box's mask glyph: a tick when checked, a dash when indeterminate."
msgstr "Glif topeng kotak: tanda semak apabila ditanda, palang apabila tidak tentu."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle border width."
msgstr "Lebar sempadan togol."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle switch height."
msgstr "Ketinggian suis togol."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The computed handle diameter."
msgstr "Diameter pemegang yang dikira."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The handle inset from each track edge."
msgstr "Inset pemegang dari setiap tepi trek."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle track width."
msgstr "Lebar trek togol."

#: css/checkbox.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — The single-select counterpart."
msgstr "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — Rakan sejawapan pemilihan tunggal."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: close-button"
msgstr ""

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-close-button` — A transparent icon button that draws its own × glyph, in three sizes plus an on-color variant."
msgstr "`.instui-close-button` — Butang ikon lutsinar yang melukis glif × sendiri, dalam tiga saiz serta varian untuk permukaan berwarna."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Always renders as an icon-only control with no visible label, so an `aria-label` is required, not optional; compare to `button`'s `-without-background` ghost variant, which keeps a text label."
msgstr "Sentiasa dirender sebagai kawalan hanya-ikon tanpa label yang kelihatan, jadi `aria-label` diperlukan, bukan pilihan; bandingkan dengan varian hantu `-without-background` pada `button` yang mengekalkan label teks."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [close-button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/close-button/close-button.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [close-button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/close-button/close-button.css)"

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the icon-only button an `aria-label` (e.g. \"Close\"), and mark a disabled button with `aria-disabled` (or the native `disabled`)."
msgstr "Berikan butang hanya-ikon sebuah `aria-label` (contoh: \"Close\"), dan tandakan butang yang dilumpuhkan dengan `aria-disabled` (atau `disabled` asli)."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For a close button placed on a coloured (non-neutral) surface."
msgstr "Untuk butang tutup yang diletakkan pada permukaan berwarna (bukan neutral)."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The × glyph, masked in `currentColor`."
msgstr "Glif ×, dimaskkan dalam `currentColor`."

#: css/close-button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [button](/api/css/button.md) — The general-purpose action button."
msgstr "- [button](/api/css/button.md) — Butang tindakan serba guna."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: color"
msgstr ""

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--text-danger` — Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`)."
msgstr "`.--text-danger` — Utiliti warna semantik: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (dialiaskan sebagai `.--color-<name>`), dan `.--border-<name>` untuk palet semantik terpilih. Setiap satu daripadanya juga mempunyai pengubah alias yang dipasang pada komponen (contohnya `-bg-danger` pada mana-mana `.instui-<component>`)."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [generate.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/scripts/generate.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [generate.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/scripts/generate.ts)"

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies the semantic danger text colour."
msgstr "Memohon warna teks bahaya semantik."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Background colour utilities for semantic and component-aligned names."
msgstr "Utiliti warna latar untuk nama yang sejajar dengan semantik dan komponen."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Border colour utilities for semantic and component-aligned names."
msgstr "Utiliti warna sempadan untuk nama yang sejajar dengan semantik dan komponen."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--text-*` for text colour utilities."
msgstr "Alias bagi `--text-*` untuk utiliti warna teks."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text colour utilities for semantic and component-aligned names."
msgstr "Utiliti warna teks untuk nama yang sejajar dengan semantik dan komponen."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: context-view"
msgstr ""

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-context-view` — An elevated callout with a caret, positionable on any side; works as a native `[popover]`."
msgstr "`.instui-context-view` — Pemberitahuan timbul bertingkat dengan caret, boleh diletakkan pada mana-mana sisi; berfungsi sebagai `[popover]` asli."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The caret is two stacked `::before`/`::after` triangles (border then fill) so it reads correctly against a matching surface; as a `[popover]` it needs the same open/`popovertarget` wiring as `popover`, but unlike `tooltip`, it dismisses on outside click or Escape."
msgstr "Caret terdiri daripada dua segitiga bertindan `::before`/`::after` (garis kemudian isian) supaya ia kelihatan betul terhadap permukaan sepadan; sebagai `[popover]` ia memerlukan sambungan buka/`popovertarget` yang sama seperti `popover`, tetapi tidak seperti `tooltip`, ia ditutup apabila diklik di luar atau menekan Escape."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [context-view.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/context-view/context-view.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [context-view.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/context-view/context-view.css)"

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dark (inverse) colour scheme."
msgstr "Skema warna Gelap (terbalik)."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit below the anchor."
msgstr "Terletak di bawah jangkar."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit at the end (inline-end) of the anchor."
msgstr "Terletak di hujung (inline-end) jangkar."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit at the start (inline-start) of the anchor."
msgstr "Terletak di permulaan (inline-start) jangkar."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sit above the anchor."
msgstr "Terletak di atas jangkar."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the caret's inner fill triangle."
msgstr "Memaparkan segitiga isian dalaman caret."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the caret's outer border triangle."
msgstr "Memaparkan segitiga bingkai luar caret."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Uses CSS anchor positioning (`position-anchor`, `position-area`, `position-try-fallbacks`) and the native `[popover]` API behind an `@supports` guard; needs a recent Chromium or Safari, and falls back to a UA-centred popover elsewhere."
msgstr "- Menggunakan penempatan anchor CSS (`position-anchor`, `position-area`, `position-try-fallbacks`) dan API `[popover]` asli di sebalik pengawal `@supports`; memerlukan Chromium atau Safari terkini, dan kembali kepada popover berpusatkan UA di tempat lain."

#: css/context-view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer popover.\n- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — A smaller hover or focus callout."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Popover lapisan atas generik.\n- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — Callout yang lebih kecil untuk hover atau fokus."

#: css/cursor.md
