#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"
msgstr "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.content` — The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "`.content` — Panel kandungan utama yang mengisi ruang selebihnya di sebelah dulang."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Once the parent's inline-size drops below `46em` (`16em` tray width + `30em` breakpoint), a `@container` query on the parent's `pantoken-drawer-layout` container drops this member's `min-inline-size` to `0` automatically, matching the manual `[should-overlay-tray]` override."
msgstr "Apabila inline-size induk turun di bawah `46em` (lebar dulang `16em` + titik putus `30em`), pertanyaan `@container` pada kontena `pantoken-drawer-layout` induk akan menurunkan `min-inline-size` ahli ini ke `0` secara automatik, sepadan dengan penimpaan manual `[should-overlay-tray]`."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Carry `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "Bawa `role=\"region\"` (konvensyen DrawerLayout InstUI) dan namakan ia dengan `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` apabila konteks sahaja tidak mengenalinya."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.tray](/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — The adjacent panel in the same flex row."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.tray](/ms/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — The adjacent panel in the same flex row."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-drawer-layout` — A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "`.instui-drawer-layout` — Susun atur berpecah dengan dulang sisi boleh-kembang dan panel kandungan utama boleh tatal."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-placement-end` and the default (start) both use `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` logical properties, not `left`/`right`, so the tray's side follows `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` automatically — no separate RTL rules are needed."
msgstr "`-placement-end` dan lalai (start) kedua-duanya menggunakan sifat logik `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*`, bukan `left`/`right`, jadi sisi dulang mengikuti `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` secara automatik — tiada peraturan RTL berasingan diperlukan."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When the tray acts as navigation, label it with an accessible heading or `aria-label`. Give `.content` `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "Apabila dulang berfungsi sebagai navigasi, labelkan ia dengan pengepala boleh-akses atau `aria-label`. Beri `.content` `role=\"region\"` (konvensyen InstUI's DrawerLayout) dan namakan ia dengan `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` apabila konteks sahaja tidak mengenalinya."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Show the tray even when the `open` attribute is absent."
msgstr "Tunjukkan dulang walaupun atribut `open` tiada."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-end side."
msgstr "Letakkan dulang di sisi inline-end."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-start side (the default; sets it explicitly)."
msgstr "Letakkan dulang di sisi inline-start (lalai; menetapkannya secara eksplisit)."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Render the tray as an overlay instead of shrinking content inline."
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The main pane."
msgstr "Panel utama."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel."
msgstr "Panel sisi."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Width threshold for overlay mode (`30em`, themed via responsive utilities)."
msgstr "Ambang lebar untuk mod overlay (`30em`, bertema melalui utiliti responsif)."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` members switch to overlay mode automatically via a `@container` query once this element's inline-size drops below tray-width + `--pantoken-bp-md`. The `@pantoken/interactions` behavior additionally toggles `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray` (a manual override) and emits `overlaytraychange` for apps that need the change as an event."
msgstr "- Ahli `drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` beralih ke mod overlay secara automatik melalui pertanyaan `@container` sebaik sahaja ukuran-inline elemen ini jatuh di bawah lebar-dulang + `--pantoken-bp-md`. Perilaku `@pantoken/interactions` juga menukar `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray` (ganti manual) dan menghantar `overlaytraychange` untuk aplikasi yang memerlukan perubahan itu sebagai acara."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A standalone edge overlay; this layout keeps tray and content in the same flow.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A smaller anchored surface for contextual actions and detail."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — Overlay tepi berdiri sendiri; susun atur ini mengekalkan dulang dan kandungan dalam aliran yang sama.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Permukaan bersandar yang lebih kecil untuk tindakan kontekstual dan butiran."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tray` — The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "`.tray` — Panel sisi di sebelah kandungan utama, dengan mod pengalas pilihan dan pengubah permukaan seperti dulang."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Positioning uses `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline` (never `left`/`right`), so `-placement-end` docks to the true trailing edge in both LTR and RTL."
msgstr "Penempatan menggunakan `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline` (tidak sekali-kali `left`/`right`), jadi `-placement-end` berlabuh ke tepi belakang sebenar dalam kedua-dua LTR dan RTL."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "If used as navigation, wrap links in a semantic `<nav>` and provide an accessible name."
msgstr "Jika digunakan sebagai navigasi, bungkus pautan dalam `<nav>` semantik dan berikan nama yang boleh diakses."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock this tray to inline-end when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "Labuhkan dulang ini ke inline-end apabila mod pengalas aktif."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove the panel edge border."
msgstr "Buang sempadan tepi panel."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove elevation when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "Buang elevasi apabila mod pengalas aktif."

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — The primary pane that flexes alongside this member."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — Pane utama yang mengembang di sebelah anggota ini."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: file-drop"
msgstr ""

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-file-drop` — A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "`.instui-file-drop` — Zon muat naik fail dengan keadaan hover, diterima, dan ditolak."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` classes are purely visual — actual drag-and-drop detection and file validation are the consumer's JS to wire up around the wrapped native input."
msgstr "Kelas `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` adalah semata-mata visual — pengesanan seret-dan-lepaskan sebenar dan pengesahan fail ialah tugas JS pengguna untuk menyambungkannya di sekitar input asli yang dibalut."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap a native `<input type=\"file\">` in the `<label>` drop zone so it stays a real, labelled file control that the keyboard and assistive tech can operate."
msgstr "Balut `<input type=\"file\">` asli dalam zon lepas `<label>` supaya ia kekal sebagai kawalan fail yang sebenar dan berlabel yang boleh dikendalikan oleh papan kekunci dan teknologi bantuan."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for an acceptable file."
msgstr "Keadaan seretan untuk fail yang boleh diterima."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hover or drag-over state."
msgstr "Keadaan hover atau semasa menyeret di atas."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render the leading dropzone glyph icon."
msgstr "Paparkan ikon glif utama zon lepas."

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for a rejected file."
msgstr "Keadaan seretan untuk fail yang ditolak."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-group` — A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-group` — Kumpulan `<fieldset>` dengan legenda, susun atur lajur atau sebaris, dan jarak yang boleh dikonfigurasikan."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between fields, tunable with the `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*` modifiers below — prefer those over chaining a generic `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier, which overrides the built-in value outright."
msgstr "Menetapkan `gap` tersendiri antara medan, boleh dilaras dengan pengubah `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*` di bawah — utamakan itu berbanding rantai pengubah utiliti jarak generik `-gap-*`, yang menimpa nilai terbina terus."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>`, so the legend text names the whole group for assistive tech."
msgstr "Menghasilkan `<fieldset>` asli dengan `<legend>`, supaya teks legenda menamakan keseluruhan kumpulan untuk teknologi bantuan."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large column gap."
msgstr "Jurang lajur besar."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium column gap."
msgstr "Jurang lajur sederhana."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No column gap."
msgstr "Tiada jurang lajur."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small column gap."
msgstr "Jurang lajur kecil."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Align child fields to a shared grid."
msgstr "Susun medan anak sejajar pada grid yang dikongsi."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields out in columns."
msgstr "Susun medan anak dalam lajur."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields inline, in a row."
msgstr "Susun medan anak sebaris, dalam satu baris."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the group as required."
msgstr "Tandakan kumpulan sebagai wajib."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large row gap."
msgstr "Jurang baris besar."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium row gap."
msgstr "Jurang baris sederhana."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No row gap."
msgstr "Tiada jurang baris."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small row gap."
msgstr "Jurang baris kecil."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the fields."
msgstr "Penyelarasan medan ke bawah (bottom-align)."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Middle-align the fields."
msgstr "Penyelarasan medan ke tengah (middle-align)."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the fields."
msgstr "Penyelarasan medan ke atas (top-align)."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the legend text when the group is required."
msgstr "Menghasilkan asterisk hiasan medan wajib selepas teks legenda apabila kumpulan ditandakan sebagai wajib."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `-layout-aligned` mode uses CSS subgrid behind an `@supports` guard; where subgrid is unsupported, the fields fall back to their own stacked layout."
msgstr "- Mod `-layout-aligned` menggunakan subgrid CSS di belakang pengawal `@supports`; jika subgrid tidak disokong, medan akan kembali kepada susun atur bertindih sendiri."

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — The single field this group repeats.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Groups radio inputs under a legend."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Medan tunggal yang diulang oleh kumpulan ini.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Mengumpulkan input radio di bawah legenda."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-messages"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Mesej bantuan medan dan pengesahan — petunjuk, ralat, kejayaan, dan hanya-pembaca-skrin — dengan glif pada ralat dan kejayaan."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between stacked messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Menetapkan `gap` sendiri di antara mesej bertindan; menyambung pengubah utiliti jarak `-gap-*` akan menggantikan nilai terbina itu."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `-type-screenreader-only` message is visually hidden but stays in the accessibility tree, so it's still announced; pair error and success messages with the field via aria-describedby so assistive tech reads them with the control."
msgstr "Mesej `-type-screenreader-only` disembunyikan secara visual tetapi kekal dalam pokok kebolehcapaian, jadi ia masih diumumkan; padankan mesej ralat dan kejayaan dengan medan melalui aria-describedby supaya teknologi bantuan membacanya bersama kawalan."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-type-error`."
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An individual message; its `-type-*` picks the hint, error, success, or screen-reader-only variant."
msgstr "Satu mesej individu; `-type-*`nya memilih varian petunjuk, ralat, kejayaan, atau hanya-pembaca-skrin."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the leading status glyph on error and success messages: an alert circle for errors and a check circle for success."
msgstr "Memaparkan glif status utama pada mesej ralat dan kejayaan: bulatan amaran untuk ralat dan bulatan tanda semak untuk kejayaan."

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Wraps a label, controls, and these messages."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Membalut label, kawalan, dan mesej-mesej ini."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field` — A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field` — Pembungkus medan borang: label, kawalannya, dan susun atur selari (inline), wajib, atau baca-sahaja."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An error message stays hidden until the field's control is `:user-invalid` (after the user interacts) or you add the `-invalid` class. Use `-layout-inline` to put the label beside the controls and `-layout-stacked` to put it above. Also sets its own `gap` between the label, controls, and messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Mesej ralat tetap tersembunyi sehingga kawalan medan menjadi `:user-invalid` (selepas pengguna berinteraksi) atau anda menambah kelas `-invalid`. Gunakan `-layout-inline` untuk meletakkan label di sisi kawalan dan `-layout-stacked` untuk meletakkannya di atas. Juga menetapkan `gap` tersendiri antara label, kawalan, dan mesej; rantai mod pemodifikasi jarak `-gap-*` menggantikan nilai terbina itu."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `<label>` element wraps the control, so the label text names it natively; the required asterisk is decorative and should be hidden from assistive tech (aria-hidden), and the error message surfaces once the control is `:user-invalid` or you add the `-invalid` class."
msgstr "Elemen `<label>` membalut kawalan, jadi teks label menamainya secara asli; asterisk wajib adalah hiasan dan harus disembunyikan dari teknologi bantuan (aria-hidden), dan mesej ralat dipaparkan setelah kawalan menjadi `:user-invalid` atau anda menambah kelas `-invalid`."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout (shorthand for `-layout-inline`)."
msgstr "Susun atur selari (pendek untuk `-layout-inline`)."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the label text."
msgstr "Petak teks label diselaraskan ke hujung (akhir)."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the label text."
msgstr "Petak teks label diselaraskan ke permulaan."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout: label beside the controls."
msgstr "Susun atur selari: label di sebelah kawalan."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stacked layout: label above the controls."
msgstr "Susun atur bertindan: label di atas kawalan."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "Selaraskan label di bahagian bawah berbanding kawalan."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "Selaraskan label di bahagian atas berbanding kawalan."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control area beside or below the label."
msgstr "Kawasan kawalan di sebelah atau di bawah label."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The field label."
msgstr "Label medan."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the label text when the field is required."
msgstr "Membentangkan asterisk hiasan untuk medan wajib selepas teks label apabila medan itu diwajibkan."

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Renders the field's hint, error, and success messages.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Groups related fields under a shared legend."
msgstr "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Membentangkan mesej petunjuk, ralat, dan kejayaan medan.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Mengumpulkan medan berkaitan di bawah legenda yang dikongsi."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: gap"
msgstr ""

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--gap-md` — Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "`.--gap-md` — Utiliti `gap` flex/grid pada skala jarak, ejaan pendek (`--gap-sm`) atau panjang (`--gap-small`). Boleh digunakan secara langsung atau dirangkai pada mana-mana komponen (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — komponen yang telah menetapkan `gap` mereka sendiri daripada token khusus komponen mungkin akan ditindih."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies the medium spacing token as the gap."
msgstr "Menerapkan token jarak sederhana sebagai ruang."

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Gap utilities across short and long spacing-step spellings."
msgstr "Utiliti ruang untuk ejaan langkah jarak pendek dan panjang."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: heading"
msgstr ""

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-heading` — Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "`.instui-heading` — Tipografi tajuk dari `-level-h1` ke `-level-h6`."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets override a `-level-*`'s font-size and font-weight, so combine only one of each family per element."
msgstr "Praset `-variant-*` menimpa `-level-*`'s font-size dan font-weight, jadi gabungkan hanya satu daripada setiap keluarga bagi setiap elemen."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "These classes set the visual level only, so render a real `<h1>`–`<h6>` (or use `role=\"heading\"` with `aria-level`) to convey the heading level."
msgstr "Kelas-kelas ini menetapkan tahap visual sahaja, jadi render `<h1>`–`<h6>` sebenar (atau gunakan `role=\"heading\"` dengan `aria-level`) untuk menyampaikan tahap tajuk."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a bottom rule."
msgstr "Tambah garis bawah."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a top rule."
msgstr "Tambah garis atas."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AI-accent colour."
msgstr "Warna aksen AI."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Primary colour."
msgstr "(lalai) Warna utama."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (primary inverse) colour."
msgstr "Warna untuk latar gelap (invers utama)."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary (muted) colour."
msgstr "Warna sekunder (pudar)."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h1 type scale."
msgstr "Render pada skala tipografi h1."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h2 type scale."
msgstr "Render pada skala tipografi h2."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h3 type scale."
msgstr "Render pada skala tipografi h3."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h4 type scale."
msgstr "Render pada skala tipografi h4."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h5 type scale."
msgstr "Render pada skala tipografi h5."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h6 type scale."
msgstr "Render pada skala tipografi h6."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label type preset."
msgstr "Praset jenis label."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mini card-title preset."
msgstr "Praset tajuk kad mini."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Regular card-title preset."
msgstr "Praset tajuk kad biasa."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Card section-title preset."
msgstr "Praset tajuk seksyen kad."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page-title preset."
msgstr "Praset tajuk halaman."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Section-title preset."
msgstr "Praset tajuk seksyen."

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography for non-heading text."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Tipografi badan untuk teks bukan tajuk."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: hero"
msgstr ""

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — Seksyen tajuk lebar-penuh dengan tajuk, tajuk kecil, dan imej latar belakang pilihan."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Hero when:"
msgstr "✅ Gunakan Hero apabila:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a prominent page header with visual hierarchy\n- The page benefits from a large, eye-catching opening section\n- You want to include background imagery or gradient accents\n🚫 Don't use Hero when:"
msgstr "- Anda memerlukan pengepala halaman yang menonjol dengan hierarki visual\n- Halaman mendapat manfaat daripada seksyen pembukaan yang besar dan menarik perhatian\n- Anda mahu menyertakan imej latar atau aksen gradasi\n🚫 Jangan gunakan Hero apabila:"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a simple page header — use Page-Layout instead\n- The hero competes with critical content — prioritize readability"
msgstr "- Membangun pengepala halaman yang ringkas — gunakan Page-Layout sebagai gantinya\n- Hero bersaing dengan kandungan penting — utamakan keterbacaan"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure the title is in an `<h1>` tag for semantic structure\n- If using background images, provide sufficient color contrast for text\n- Avoid autoplay on video or animation that could distract from content"
msgstr "- Pastikan tajuk berada dalam tag `<h1>` untuk struktur semantik\n- Jika menggunakan imej latar, sediakan kontras warna yang mencukupi untuk teks\n- Elakkan main automatik video atau animasi yang boleh mengalih perhatian dari kandungan"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero subtitle content"
msgstr "Kandungan tajuk kecil Hero"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero title content"
msgstr "Kandungan tajuk Hero"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional action buttons or links."
msgstr "Butang tindakan atau pautan pilihan."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional background layer (image or gradient)."
msgstr "Lapisan latar pilihan (imej atau gradasi)."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for hero text and actions."
msgstr "Kontena untuk teks dan tindakan hero."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional semi-transparent overlay for text contrast."
msgstr "Lapisan bertindih separa telus pilihan untuk kontras teks."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional supporting text or description."
msgstr "Teks sokongan atau keterangan pilihan."

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Main hero title (typically `<h1>`)."
msgstr "Tajuk utama hero (biasanya `<h1>`)."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: icon"
msgstr ""

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-icon` — The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "`.instui-icon` — Sistem ikon: saiz `.instui-icon` ditambah pelukis bersama `-icon-<name>` yang menutup glif (dalam `currentColor`) sebelum sebarang elemen."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph is decorative, so mark it `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; give it a `role` or label only when the icon conveys meaning on its own."
msgstr "Glif itu hiasan, jadi tandakan ia `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; berikan ia `role` atau label hanya apabila ikon menyampaikan maksud dengan sendirinya."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set the glyph token (`--pantoken-glyph`) and render it via the shared painter (for example `-icon-search`)."
msgstr "Tetapkan token glif (`--pantoken-glyph`) dan papar ia melalui pelukis bersama (contohnya `-icon-search`)."

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph itself: a 1em box masked from `--pantoken-glyph` and filled with `currentColor`."
msgstr "Glif itu sendiri: kotak 1em yang dimaskkan daripada `--pantoken-glyph` dan diisi dengan `currentColor`."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: img"
msgstr ""

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-img` — A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "`.instui-img` — Sebuah `<img>` berstail dengan pengubah paparan, pemangkasan, dan kesan yang bertindih."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Effects compose through the shared `--pantoken-img-filter` custom property, so `-with-grayscale` and `-with-blur` can apply together; the `-constrain-*` crop modifiers require the consumer to size the box explicitly."
msgstr "Kesan digabung melalui sifat tersuai `--pantoken-img-filter` yang dikongsi, jadi `-with-grayscale` dan `-with-blur` boleh digunakan bersama; pengubah pemangkasan `-constrain-*` memerlukan pengguna menetapkan saiz kotak secara eksplisit."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Provide meaningful `alt` text that describes the image, and use an empty `alt=\"\"` for purely decorative images so assistive tech skips them."
msgstr "Berikan teks `alt` yang bermakna yang menerangkan imej, dan gunakan `alt=\"\"` kosong untuk imej semata-mata hiasan supaya teknologi bantuan mengabaikannya."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fit within the box (contain)."
msgstr "Skala untuk muat dalam kotak (contain)."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fill the box (cover)."
msgstr "Skala untuk mengisi kotak (cover)."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display as a block element."
msgstr "Papar sebagai elemen blok."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a blur effect."
msgstr "Terapkan kesan kabur."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a grayscale effect."
msgstr "Terapkan kesan skala kelabu."

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — The composed CSS filter on the image; the effect modifiers set it, and you can override it for a custom filter."
msgstr "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — Penapis CSS tersusun pada imej; pengubah kesan menetapkannya, dan anda boleh menimpanya untuk penapis tersuai."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: in-place-edit"
msgstr ""

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-in-place-edit` — A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "`.instui-in-place-edit` — Sebuah [contenteditable] yang dibaca sebagai teks sehingga difokuskan, kemudian memaparkan chrome input."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The input chrome only appears while focused; `-readonly` suppresses both the hover and focus affordances so the element always reads as plain inline text."
msgstr "Chrome input hanya muncul semasa difokuskan; `-readonly` menghalang kedua-dua ciri hover dan fokus supaya elemen sentiasa dibaca sebagai teks sebaris biasa."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the editable element `role=\"textbox\"` and an accessible name (`aria-label`)."
msgstr "Berikan elemen boleh sunting `role=\"textbox\"` dan nama boleh diakses (`aria-label`)."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shown inline but not editable (no hover/focus affordance)."
msgstr "Dipaparkan sebaris tetapi tidak boleh disunting (tiada ciri hover/fokus)."

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — On focus it shows the same input chrome as a text input."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Apabila difokuskan ia memaparkan chrome input yang sama seperti input teks."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS API reference"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS API reference covers pantoken's class-based component layer: components, utilities, global rules, and declarations built on the token system."
msgstr "Rujukan API CSS merangkumi lapisan komponen berasaskan kelas pantoken: komponen, utiliti, peraturan global, dan deklarasi yang dibina di atas sistem token."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Components"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nama"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Class"
msgstr "Kelas"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Ringkasan"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container for AI agents."
msgstr "Bekas permukaan untuk ejen AI."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline message with a status colour bar and a masked status glyph from the shared icon set."
msgstr "Mesej sebaris dengan bar warna status dan glif status yang disamarkan dari set ikon dikongsi."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A user avatar showing initials or an image, circular by default."
msgstr "Avatar pengguna yang memaparkan inisial atau imej, bulat secara lalai."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small count or status dot placed over a target's corner."
msgstr "Noktah kiraan atau status kecil yang diletakkan di atas sudut sasaran."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dismissible, iconed message surface for page-level or in-context announcements."
msgstr "Permukaan mesej boleh ditutup dengan ikon untuk pengumuman peringkat halaman atau konteks."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large empty-state or call-to-action block: a hero icon or image, a heading, and a message."
msgstr "Blok negeri kosong atau panggilan-untuk-tindakan yang besar: ikon atau imej hero, tajuk, dan mesej."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A breadcrumb trail with separators; the last crumb is the current page."
msgstr "Jejak remah roti dengan pemisah; remah terakhir ialah halaman semasa."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A crumb (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), an `<li>` in the parent's `<ol>`; the last one is the current page."
msgstr "Sebuah remah (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), sebuah `<li>` dalam `<ol>` induk; yang terakhir ialah halaman semasa."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "Kawalan tindakan boleh diakses, berstail dari palet token; utama secara lalai."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A media object: a hero figure beside a title and description."
msgstr "Objek media: figur hero di sebelah tajuk dan penerangan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A static month grid with navigation, weekday headers, and day cells."
msgstr "Grid bulan statik dengan navigasi, pengepala hari minggu, dan sel hari."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A day cell (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); `-today`, `-selected`, and `-outside-month` mark its state."
msgstr "Sel hari (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); `-today`, `-selected`, dan `-outside-month` menandakan keadaannya."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container that accepts arbitrary content."
msgstr "Bekas permukaan yang menerima kandungan sebarang."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native checkbox and its label, or a switch via `-variant-toggle`."
msgstr "Kotak semak natif dan labelnya, atau suis melalui `-variant-toggle`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A transparent icon button that draws its own × glyph, in three sizes plus an on-color variant."
msgstr "Butang ikon lutsinar yang melukis glif × sendiri, dalam tiga saiz plus variasi pada warna latar."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated callout with a caret, positionable on any side; works as a native `[popover]`."
msgstr "Panggilan tinggi dengan caret, boleh diposisikan di mana-mana sisi; berfungsi sebagai `[popover]` natif."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "Susun atur berbelah dengan dulang sisi boleh kuncup dan pane kandungan utama yang boleh skrol."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "Pane kandungan utama yang mengisi ruang baki di sebelah dulang."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "Panel sisi di sebelah kandungan utama, dengan overlay pilihan dan pengubah permukaan seperti dulang."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "Zon jatuh fail dengan keadaan hover, diterima, dan ditolak."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "Pembalut medan borang: label, kawalannya, dan susun atur inline, wajib, atau baca sahaja."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "Kumpulan `<fieldset>` dengan legenda, susun atur lajur atau sebaris, dan jarak boleh laras."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "Bantuan medan dan mesej pengesahan — petunjuk, ralat, kejayaan, dan hanya-pembaca skrin — dengan glif pada ralat dan kejayaan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "Tipografi tajuk dari `-level-h1` ke `-level-h6`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "Sebuah `<img>` berstail dengan pengubah paparan, potong, dan kesan yang bertindih."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "Sebuah [contenteditable] yang dibaca sebagai teks sehingga difokuskan, kemudian memaparkan krom input."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "Facade di sekitar input teks dengan slot ikon di hadapan dan di belakang."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "Hyperlink berstail dengan saiz, variasi songsang untuk latar gelap, dan bentuk sebaris atau tanpa gaya."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "Senarai dengan jarak item yang dipacu oleh token."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "Item senarai (InstUI `List.Item`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "Overlay aliran yang mengisi ibu bapa yang diposisikan dan menjengahkan kandungannya di tengah — contohnya spinner di atas kad. Untuk modal, utamakan `<dialog>` natif ( `::backdrop` adalah masker). Setiap satu pengubah ini juga tersedia secara global (telanjang, atau diikat pada komponen lain) — lihat utiliti global `mask`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "Permukaan dropdown yang mengandungi item, kumpulan, dan pemisah."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "Tajuk kumpulan berlabel (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "Entri menu (InstUI `Menu.Item`); tambah -disabled, -highlighted, atau -active/[aria-checked]."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "Garis pemisah antara item (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "Statistik berlabel — nilai besar di atas kapsyen."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "Permukaan dialog (berfungsi pada native <dialog>); bahagian pengepala/badan/kaki."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "Ruang kandungan (InstUI `Modal.Body`); `<img>` tunggal mengisi penuh."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "Bar tindakan (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "Bar tajuk (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "Facade input nombor dengan lajur spinner +/-."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page navigation: numbered pages, first, previous, next, and last arrows, and an ellipsis for gaps."
msgstr "Navigasi halaman: muka surat bernombor, anak panah pertama, sebelumnya, seterusnya, dan terakhir, serta elipsis untuk jurang."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A page link or button (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); the current page carries `[aria-current]`."
msgstr "Pautan atau butang halaman (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); halaman semasa membawa `[aria-current]`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A compact status label; add a leading glyph with the shared `-icon-<name>` form."
msgstr "Label status kompak; tambah glif di hadapan dengan bentuk `-icon-<name>` dikongsi."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated surface for a native `[popover]`, positioned with CSS anchor positioning."
msgstr "Permukaan tinggi untuk `[popover]` natif, diposisikan dengan penentuan sauh CSS."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "Bar kemajuan tertentu dengan meter berwarna, saiz, dan label nilai pilihan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A circular progress ring driven by `--value` and `--value-max` custom properties."
msgstr "Cincin kemajuan bulat yang digerakkan oleh sifat tersuai `--value` dan `--value-max`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "Butang radio natif dan labelnya."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "Kumpulan radio satu-pilih `<fieldset>`, biasa atau sebagai togol bersegmen berhubung."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "Slider julat berstail dengan gelembung nilai songsang."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "Penarafan bintang dengan glif terisi dan kosong serta label nombor pilihan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "Rel navigasi menegak item ikon-atas-label, dengan mod diminimumkan hanya ikon."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "Entri navigasi (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` menandakan yang aktif."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<select>` with a caret, matching the text-input states and sizes."
msgstr "`<select>` natif berstail dengan caret, menyamai keadaan dan saiz input teks."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An animated loading ring; give it role=\"status\" and an aria-label."
msgstr "Cincin pemuatan animasi; berikan role=\"status\" dan aria-label."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "Jadual data berstail untuk `th` dan `td` serta kapsyen pilihan, dengan tata letak hover, tetap, dan kad bertindan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "Kumpulan baris data jadual (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "Sel data (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "Sel pengepala lajur (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); gaya lalai `th` diatasi oleh `table.row-header` untuk `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "Kumpulan baris pengepala jadual (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "Baris jadual (InstUI `Table.Row`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "Sel pengepala baris (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); bergaya dari token pengepala baris, bukan token pengepala lajur."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "Set panel ber-tab: senarai tab, tab boleh pilih, dan panel mereka."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "Panel kandungan untuk tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "Butang tab tunggal (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, dikonfigurasikan melalui senarai tab `Tabs` induk); `-selected` menandakan yang aktif."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "Cip selari untuk kata kunci atau penapis."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "Tipografi teks badan dengan pengubah saiz, ketebalan, warna, dan gaya."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "`<textarea>` natif yang berstail dan boleh diubah saiz dengan keadaan dan saiz yang sama seperti input teks."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "`<input>` natif yang berstail — termasuk `date`, `time`, dan `datetime-local`, di mana pelayar menyediakan pemilih — dengan keadaan pengesahan dan saiz."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "`<details>` natif yang berstail sebagai pendedahan dengan chevron berpusing."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "Pendedahan berbingkai dibina di atas `<details>`: baris ringkasan chevron dan kandungan boleh lipat."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "Buah sembang tooltip CSS untuk hover dan fokus, boleh diposisikan pada mana-mana sisi."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "Panel terpaut tepi yang meluncur masuk dari mana-mana sisi; `[popover]` atau `<dialog>` natif."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "Pokok pendedahan koleksi bertingkat dan item daun, dengan chevron berpusing."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The View primitive: a neutral box with key-value modifiers for background, border, radius, shadow, display, position, overflow, and cursor. Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` utilities."
msgstr "Primitif View: kotak neutral dengan pengubah pasangan kunci-nilai untuk latar, sempadan, radius, bayang, paparan, posisi, limpahan, dan kursor. Setiap pengubah ini juga tersedia secara global (terus, atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen) — lihat utiliti `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Utilities"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`)."
msgstr "Utiliti warna semantik: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (alias sebagai `.--color-<name>`), dan `.--border-<name>` untuk palet semantik yang dikurasi. Setiap satu juga mempunyai alias pengubah terlampir-komponen (contohnya `-bg-danger` pada mana-mana `.instui-<component>`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`cursor` as a composable, global class — `.--cursor-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."
msgstr "`cursor` sebagai kelas global yang boleh disusun — `.--cursor-<value>` — boleh digunakan terus atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "Utiliti flex/grid `gap` pada skala jarak, ejaan pendek (`--gap-sm`) atau panjang (`--gap-small`). Boleh digunakan terus atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — komponen yang sudah menetapkan `gap` mereka dari token khusus-komponen mungkin diatasi."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "Sistem ikon: saiz `.instui-icon` ditambah pelukis `-icon-<name>` yang berkongsi yang menapis glif (dalam `currentColor`) sebelum sebarang elemen."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "Utiliti paparan dan penjajaran teks — `.--display-<value>` dan `.--text-align-<value>` — sebagai kelas global yang boleh disusun, boleh digunakan terus atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "Salinan dwiganda global pemodifier overlay komponen `mask` — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — boleh digunakan terus atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen, tanpa membalut dalam elemen `.instui-mask`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` as composable, global classes — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` sebagai kelas global yang boleh disusun — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — boleh digunakan terus atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`position` as a composable, global class — `.--position-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."
msgstr "`position` sebagai kelas global yang boleh disusun — `.--position-<value>` — boleh digunakan terus atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "Kelas tunjuk/sembunyi lebar viewport atau kontena merentas skala titik henti ber tema."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Visually hides content while keeping it available to assistive tech (the standard clip pattern)."
msgstr "Menyembunyikan kandungan secara visual sambil mengekalkannya tersedia untuk teknologi bantuan (pola clip standard)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "Utiliti margin dan padding — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` dan `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` pada skala jarak (sisi `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` atau tiada, dieja pendek atau panjang sepenuhnya — contohnya `--mb-sm` dan `--margin-bottom-small` adalah peraturan yang sama; margin juga menerima `auto`). Boleh digunakan sendiri atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen (contohnya `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "Utiliti kedalaman z-index — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — boleh digunakan sendiri atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen, supaya lapisan disusun secara boleh diramal dan bukannya nombor yang disesuaikan secara manual."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "Kelas keadaan animasi untuk komponen `Transition` — `.instui-transition` dan kelas keadaan (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, dan sebagainya) — boleh digunakan sendiri atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "Pemendekan ellipsis dengan penguncian baris dikawal oleh `--lines` — boleh digunakan sendiri atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A layout-debugging outline: compound `.-with-visual-debug` onto any element to outline the box and its immediate children, so a layout's structure is visible at a glance."
msgstr "Satu garisan sempadan untuk penyahpepijatan susun atur: gabungkan kompaun `.-with-visual-debug` pada mana-mana elemen untuk menandakan kotak dan anak-anak hampirnya, supaya struktur susun atur kelihatan sekilas."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Rules"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The opt-in global reset: `box-sizing`, the page surface, base text colour and font, `color-scheme`, and link defaults."
msgstr "Reset global pilihan: `box-sizing`, permukaan halaman, warna teks asas dan fon, `color-scheme`, dan tetapan lalai pautan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "Tetapan tipografi lalai untuk HTML mentah — tajuk, perenggan, senarai, pautan, dan kod — digunakan secara automatik di mana sahaja diimport (lalai `:where(body)`); berikan `options.scope` untuk mensasarkan akar kandungan yang berbeza jika perlu (contohnya `.vp-doc`)."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Plugins"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure product logos as CSS image tokens: `--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` holds a data-URI SVG, so a logo paints via e.g. `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)`."
msgstr "Logo produk Instructure sebagai token imej CSS: `--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` mengandungi data-URI SVG, jadi logo boleh dicat contohnya melalui `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)`."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Opt-in utility classes for the raw primitive palette: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` paint a colour from the primitive colour tokens, plus `font-family`/`font-weight` utilities for the primitive font tokens. Kept out of the semantic utilities so overrides there stay semantic-only."
msgstr "Kelas utiliti pilihan untuk palet primitif mentah: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` mengecat warna dari token warna primitif, serta utiliti `font-family`/`font-weight` untuk token fon primitif. Dikeluarkan dari utiliti semantik supaya ganti nilai di situ kekal semantik sahaja."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline information alert for a short reminder or note."
msgstr "Amaran maklumat sebaris untuk peringatan atau nota ringkas."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "Bahagian kepala skrin seluruh lebar dengan tajuk, subtajuk, dan imej latar pilihan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "Susun atur halaman standard tiga lajur dengan kepala, bar sisi, dan kandungan utama."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators."
msgstr "Nota berstruktur dengan kategori rubrik dan petunjuk pemarkahan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "Paparan petikan atau testimoni dengan atribusi dan imejan pilihan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "Susun atur dua lajur dengan kawasan kandungan kiri dan kanan."

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "Baris cengkerang aplikasi: navigasi sisi, bekas dengan header, dan panel pilihan."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-input-group` — A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "`.instui-input-group` — Sebuah lapisan pembungkus untuk input teks dengan slot ikon di hadapan dan di belakang."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wraps the same field chrome as `text-input` with icon slots either side of it; `-should-not-wrap` is only needed when the group's contents would otherwise overflow onto a second line."
msgstr "Membungkus chrome medan yang sama seperti `text-input` dengan slot ikon di kedua-dua belah; `-should-not-wrap` hanya diperlukan apabila kandungan kumpulan akan melimpah ke baris kedua."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/input-group/input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/input-group/input-group.css)"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Disabled state."
msgstr "Keadaan dilumpuhkan."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the group on one line (no wrapping)."
msgstr "Pastikan kumpulan pada satu baris (tiada pembungkusan)."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success (valid) state."
msgstr "Keadaan berjaya (sah)."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The trailing content slot."
msgstr "Slot kandungan hujung."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The leading content slot."
msgstr "Slot kandungan hadapan."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The placeholder text of the inner input, in a muted color."
msgstr "Teks tempat letak bagi input dalaman, dalam warna yang pudar."

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Wraps a text input, adding leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Membungkus input teks, menambah slot ikon di hadapan dan di belakang."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--display-flex` — Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.--display-flex` — utiliti paparan dan penjajaran teks — `.--display-<value>` dan `.--text-align-<value>` — sebagai kelas global yang boleh disusun, boleh digunakan terus atau disambungkan pada mana-mana komponen."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets `display: flex`."
msgstr "Menetapkan `display: flex`."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display utilities: `block`, `inline-block`, `inline`, `flex`, `inline-flex`, and `none`."
msgstr "Utiliti paparan: `block`, `inline-block`, `inline`, `flex`, `inline-flex`, dan `none`."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text-alignment utilities: `start`, `center`, `end`, and `justify`."
msgstr "Utiliti penjajaran teks: `start`, `center`, `end`, dan `justify`."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: link"
msgstr ""

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-link` — A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "`.instui-link` — Pautan berinai bergaya dengan saiz, varian songsang untuk latar gelap, dan bentuk sebaris atau tanpa gaya."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own responsive `gap` between an icon and its text (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Menetapkan `gap` responsif antara ikon dan teksnya (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` mengubah skalanya); merangkaian pengubah utiliti jarak `-gap-*` akan menggantikan nilai terbina itu."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a disabled link with `aria-disabled=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Tandakan pautan dilumpuhkan dengan `aria-disabled=\"true\"`."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For dark backgrounds."
msgstr "Untuk latar gelap."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline link, underlined within flowing text."
msgstr "Pautan sebaris, bergaris bawah dalam teks beralir."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "Pautan sebaris besar (digunakan dengan `-inline`)."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "Pautan sebaris kecil (digunakan dengan `-inline`)."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Strip link styling: inherit colour, no underline."
msgstr "Buang gaya pautan: warisi warna, tiada garis bawah."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — A breadcrumb trail is built from links; also its small-screen fallback (pair with the `responsive` utility to swap Breadcrumb for a Link below ~768px)."
msgstr "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — Jejak navigasi dibina daripada pautan; juga merupakan penetapan balik untuk skrin kecil (padankan dengan utiliti `responsive` untuk menukar Breadcrumb kepada Link di bawah ~768px)."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — Item senarai (InstUI `List.Item`)."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `list`'s `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, and `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` modifiers restyle this member — see `list`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Pengubah suai `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, dan `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` pada induk `list` menata semula ahli ini — lihat dokumentasi `list` untuk pengubah suai tersebut."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a dashed rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "Pisahkan item dengan garis putus-putus. @affects list.item — Menambahkan peraturan pemisah antara item."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a solid rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "Pisahkan item dengan garis pepejal. @affects list.item — Menambahkan peraturan pemisah antara item."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ordered-list numbering. @affects list.item — Adds marker weight and indentation."
msgstr "Penomboran senarai berurutan. @affects list.item — Menambahkan ketebalan penanda dan indentasi."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the list bullet or ordered-list number."
msgstr "Memaparkan peluru senarai atau nombor senarai berurutan."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — Senarai dengan jarak item dikawal oleh token."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `padding-inline-start` for list indentation; chaining a `-p*`/`-padding*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value. See the `list.item` member for the individual items."
msgstr "Menetapkan `padding-inline-start` sendiri untuk inden senarai; menggabungkan pemodifikasi utiliti jarak `-p*`/`-padding*` akan menimpa nilai terbina itu. Lihat ahli `list.item` untuk item individu."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"

