#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: mask"
msgstr ""

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-mask` — An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "`.instui-mask` — Suatu overlay dalam aliran yang mengisi induk yang diposisikan dan memusatkan kandungannya — contohnya pemintal di atas kad. Untuk modal, gunakan `<dialog>` asli ( `::backdrop` adalah topeng). Setiap pengubah ini juga tersedia secara global (tanpa, atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen lain) — lihat utiliti global `mask`."

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur what's behind the mask with a backdrop-filter."
msgstr "Kaburkan apa yang di belakang topeng menggunakan backdrop-filter."

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed to the viewport, covering it at a high z-index."
msgstr "Ditetapkan pada viewport, menutupinya pada z-index yang tinggi."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: maskglobal"
msgstr ""

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--mask-overlay` — A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "`.--mask-overlay` — Salinan ganda global bagi pengubah suai overlay komponen `mask` — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — boleh digunakan terus atau dirangkaikan pada mana-mana komponen, tanpa membungkus dalam elemen `.instui-mask`."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The full mask overlay (position, centring, background)."
msgstr "Overlay topeng penuh (kedudukan, penjajaran di tengah, latar belakang)."

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.group"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.group"

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.group` — A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "`.group` — Tajuk kumpulan berlabel (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "`.item` — Entri menu (InstUI `Menu.Item`); tambah -disabled, -highlighted, atau -active/[aria-checked]."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a checked item with `aria-checked=\"true\"` (same styling as `-active`)."
msgstr "Tandakan item yang dipilih dengan `aria-checked=\"true\"` (gaya yang sama seperti `-active`)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Active/checked highlight; same styling as `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "Sorotan aktif/dipilih; gaya yang sama seperti `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Muted, non-interactive."
msgstr "Redup, tidak interaktif."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlighted background/text (keyboard focus or hover)."
msgstr "Latar/teks disorot (fokus papan kekunci atau hover)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary info text within the item."
msgstr "Teks maklumat sekunder dalam item."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu"
msgstr "# CSS: menu"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-menu` — A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "`.instui-menu` — Satu permukaan dropdown untuk item, kumpulan, dan pemisah."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compose entries as `.item` (see the `menu.item` member), label a section with `.group` (see `menu.group`), and divide sections with `.separator` (see `menu.separator`)."
msgstr "Susun entri sebagai `.item` (lihat anggota `menu.item`), beri label pada bahagian dengan `.group` (lihat `menu.group`), dan bahagi bahagian dengan `.separator` (lihat `menu.separator`)."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tree-browser](/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."
msgstr "- [tree-browser](/ms/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/ms/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.separator"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.separator"

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.separator` — A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "`.separator` — Garis pemisah antara item (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: metric"
msgstr ""

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-metric` — A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "`.instui-metric` — Statistik berlabel — nilai besar di atas kapsyen."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the value and label, and its own horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values."
msgstr "Menetapkan `gap` tersendiri antara nilai dan label, dan `padding` mendatar tersendiri; merangkai modifier utiliti jarak `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` akan menggantikan nilai terbina tersebut."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Centre the value and label."
msgstr "Pusatkan nilai dan label."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the value and label."
msgstr "Jajarkan nilai dan label ke hujung."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the value and label."
msgstr "Jajarkan nilai dan label ke awal."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The caption beneath the value."
msgstr "Kapsyen di bawah nilai."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The large metric number."
msgstr "Nombor metrik besar."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.body"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.body"

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `&lt;img&gt;` goes full-bleed."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Modifier `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, dan `-color-inverse` pada induk `modal` menata semula anggota ini — lihat dokumentasi `modal` sendiri untuk modifier-modifier tersebut."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.footer"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.footer"

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.footer` — The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "`.footer` — Bar tindakan (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-density-compact` and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Pengubah `-density-compact` dan `-color-inverse` bagi induk `modal` mengubah gaya ahli ini — lihat dokumentasi `modal` sendiri untuk pengubah tersebut."

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.header"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.header"

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.header` — The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "`.header` — Baris tajuk (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal"
msgstr ""

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-modal` — A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "`.instui-modal` — Permukaan dialog (berfungsi pada native <dialog>); bahagian header/body/footer."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `modal.header`, `modal.body`, and `modal.footer` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Lihat ahli `modal.header`, `modal.body`, dan `modal.footer` untuk bahagian individu."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Open the native `<dialog>` with `showModal()` for modal semantics and Esc-to-close, and name it with `aria-labelledby` pointing at the `.header`."
msgstr "Buka native `<dialog>` dengan `showModal()` untuk semantik modal dan Esc-untuk-tutup, dan namakan ia dengan `aria-labelledby` yang menunjuk kepada `.header`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur the backdrop behind the modal."
msgstr "Kaburkan latar belakang di belakang modal."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark chrome (pairs with a media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Recolours each part for the on-dark look."
msgstr "Chrome berwarna gelap (dipadankan dengan badan media). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Menukar warna setiap bahagian untuk rupa on-dark."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter part padding. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Tightens each part's padding."
msgstr "Padding bahagian lebih ketat. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Mengekangkan padding setiap bahagian."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Constrain to the viewport and scroll the body. @affects modal.body — Scrolls the body when the modal is capped to the viewport."
msgstr "Hadkan ke viewport dan skrol badan. @affects modal.body — Menggulung badan apabila modal dihadkan kepada viewport."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sized to content."
msgstr "Bersaiz mengikut kandungan."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Edge-to-edge."
msgstr "Tepi-ke-tepi."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Modal lebar. Alias panjang untuk `-size-lg`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal."
msgstr "Modal lebar."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal."
msgstr "Modal sempit."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Modal sempit. Alias panjang untuk `-size-sm`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dims the page behind the dialog as its mask, and frosts it under `-blur`."
msgstr "Menggelapkan halaman di belakang dialog sebagai topengnya, dan membuat kabut di bawah `-blur`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Styles a native &lt;dialog&gt; and its `::backdrop`; the top-layer rendering and backdrop styling need a browser that supports the dialog element."
msgstr "- Menggayakan native <dialog> dan `::backdrop`-nya; rendering lapisan atas dan gaya backdrop memerlukan pelayar yang menyokong elemen dialog."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A tray is the same dismissible overlay pattern, anchored to a screen edge."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — Tray adalah corak overlay boleh-dibuang yang sama, dipasang pada tepi skrin."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: number-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-number-input` — A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "`.instui-number-input` — Suatu antara muka input nombor dengan lajur pemintal +/-."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `.arrows` buttons are `aria-hidden` and purely presentational — incrementing/decrementing the value on click is the consumer's JS to wire up."
msgstr "Butang `.arrows` adalah `aria-hidden` dan semata-mata untuk persembahan — menambah/menurunkan nilai pada klik adalah JS pengguna untuk disambungkan."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Put the accessible name on the `<input>` (e.g. `aria-label`) so the field owns the value; the +/- spinner buttons are decorative and marked `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Letakkan nama boleh-diakses pada `<input>` (contoh `aria-label`) supaya medan memiliki nilai; butang pemintal +/- adalah hiasan dan ditandakan `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium."
msgstr "(lalai) Sederhana."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "(lalai) Sederhana. Alias bentuk panjang bagi `-size-md`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The +/- spinner column at the inline-end."
msgstr "Lajur pemintal +/- di hujung sebaris."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The decrement button; the unclassed button increments."
msgstr "Butang untuk menurunkan nilai; butang tanpa kelas menaikkan nilai."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The masked chevron glyph on each spinner button: up to increment, down on `.down`."
msgstr "Ikon chevron berlapik pada setiap butang pemintal: atas untuk menaikkan, bawah pada `.down`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
