msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The minimum meter value (default `0`)."
msgstr "Nilai meter minima (lalai `0`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled arc (meter) colour; the -color-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Warna lengkungan terisi (meter); pengubah -color-* menetapkannya."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The ring's stroke width; the -size-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Lebar strok gelung; pengubah -size-* menetapkannya."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The unfilled track colour."
msgstr "Warna trek yang tidak terisi."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value; registered with @property so it can transition."
msgstr "Nilai progres semasa; didaftarkan dengan @property supaya ia boleh beralih."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias {@link --max} The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "@alias {@link --max} Nilai progres maksimum (lalai `100`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias Alias for `--value`."
msgstr "@alias Alias untuk `--value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Registers the numeric progress properties with `@property` and paints with CSS `mask` and `conic-gradient`; where custom-property transitions are unsupported the ring still renders but won't animate."
msgstr "- Mendaftar sifat nombor progres dengan `@property` dan melukis dengan CSS `mask` dan `conic-gradient`; apabila peralihan sifat tersuai tidak disokong, gelung masih dirender tetapi tidak akan dianimasikan."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — The linear bar form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — Bentuk bar linear bagi progres yang sama dan boleh ditentukan."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: progress"
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Bar kemajuan tertentu dengan meter berwarna, saiz, dan label nilai pilihan."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.value` is a sibling of `.bar`, both children of the root — mirroring how progress-circle nests its own `.value` part. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), animating `.bar` as a sliding segment and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
msgstr "`.value` adalah adik-beradik kepada `.bar`, kedua-duanya anak kepada root — mencerminkan bagaimana progress-circle menyarang bahagian `.value` sendiri. InstUI tiada keadaan tak tentu; `:indeterminate` ialah anggaran terbaik khusus pantoken (native `<progress>` tanpa atribut `value`), menganimasikan `.bar` sebagai segmen gelongsor dan menyembunyikan `.value` kerana tiada nombor bermakna untuk dipaparkan. `<meter>` tiada keadaan tak tentu, jadi ia tidak terjejas."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders `.value` inside the track, aligned to its start, instead of beside it; style it for legibility over the meter colour."
msgstr "Memaparkan `.value` di dalam trek, sejajar dengan permulaannya, bukan di sebelahnya; gayakan untuk keterbacaan di atas warna meter."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Animate meter changes over half a second."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled meter bar."
msgstr "Bar meter yang terisi."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text beside the bar."
msgstr "Teks nilai di sebelah bar."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; animates `.bar` as a sliding segment and hides `.value`."
msgstr "Tersuai, bukan sebahagian InstUI. Digunakan hanya pada native `<progress>` yang tiada atribut `value`; menganimasikan `.bar` sebagai segmen gelongsor dan menyembunyikan `.value`."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the track's bottom rule as its own layer over the meter, so the full border and the bottom border stay independent across themes."
msgstr "Melukis garis bawah trek sebagai lapisan sendiri di atas meter, supaya sempadan penuh dan sempadan bawah kekal berasingan merentas tema."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value."
msgstr "Nilai kemajuan semasa."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Scopes the meter part rules with the `@scope` at-rule; browsers without `@scope` support ignore those scoped rules."
msgstr "- Melakukan skop peraturan bahagian meter dengan at-rule `@scope`; pelayar tanpa sokongan `@scope` mengabaikan peraturan berskop tersebut."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — The circular form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — Bentuk bulat bagi kemajuan tertentu yang sama."

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: prose"
msgstr "# CSS: prose"

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`:where(body)` — Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "`:where(body)` — Tetapan tipografi lalai untuk HTML mentah — pengepala, perenggan, senarai, pautan, dan kod — digunakan secara automatik di mana sahaja ia diimport (lalai `:where(body)`); berikan `options.scope` untuk mensasarkan akar kandungan yang berbeza sebaliknya (contohnya `.vp-doc`)."

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio-input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio-input-group` — A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "`.instui-radio-input-group` — Satu kawalan radio pemilihan tunggal `<fieldset>`, biasa atau sebagai togol bersegmen yang bersambung."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between radios; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Menetapkan `gap`nya sendiri antara radio; menyambung pengubah utiliti jarak `-gap-*` akan menggantikan nilai terbina itu."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>` that names the group; the child radios share one `name`, so only one can be selected at a time."
msgstr "Membentangkan `<fieldset>` asli dengan `<legend>` yang menamakan kumpulan; radio anak berkongsi satu `name`, jadi hanya satu boleh dipilih pada satu-satu masa."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### Toggle variant"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out in columns."
msgstr "Susunkan radio dalam lajur."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out inline."
msgstr "Susunkan radio secara sebaris."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the child toggles out as a segmented control (only the selected segment fills)."
msgstr "Susunkan togol anak sebagai kawalan bersegmen (hanya segmen yang dipilih diisi)."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — The individual control this group collects.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — The general wrapper for grouping and laying out fields."
msgstr "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — Kawalan individu yang dikumpulkan oleh kumpulan ini.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Pembungkus umum untuk mengelompokkan dan menyusun medan."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio` — A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "`.instui-radio` — Butang radio asli dan labelnya."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the control and its label; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Menetapkan `gap` sendiri antara kawalan dan labelnya; menggunakan pengubah utiliti jarak `-gap-*` secara berantai akan menimpa nilai terbina itu."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native `<input type=\"radio\">` drives `:checked` and `:disabled`; `-readonly` is styling only, since radios have no native readonly attribute."
msgstr "Satu `<input type=\"radio\">` asli mengawal `:checked` dan `:disabled`; `-readonly` hanya untuk gaya, kerana radio tidak mempunyai atribut readonly asli."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Danger context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Warna konteks bahaya (varian togol)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Off/neutral context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Warna konteks mati/neutral (varian togol)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Warna konteks kejayaan (varian togol)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Warna konteks amaran (varian togol)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-variant-toggle`."
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render as a segmented toggle button."
msgstr "Dipaparkan sebagai butang togol bersegmen."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled inner dot shown when checked; on `-variant-toggle` it is the focus ring drawn just outside the pill."
msgstr "Titik dalaman terisi yang ditunjukkan apabila diperiksa; pada `-variant-toggle` ia ialah cincin fokus yang dilukis tepat di luar pil."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle's selected fill colour; the -context-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Warna isian terpilih togol; pengubah -context-* yang menetapkannya."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — The multi-select counterpart to a single-select radio.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Collects radios into one single-select fieldset."
msgstr "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — Padanan pelbagai-pemilihan kepada radio satu-pemilihan.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Mengumpulkan radio ke dalam satu fieldset satu-pemilihan."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: range-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-range-input` — A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "`.instui-range-input` — Geser julat berstail dengan gelembung nilai songsang."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each vendor thumb/track pseudo-element needs its own separate rule — grouping them in one selector list would invalidate the whole rule in browsers that don't recognize the other vendor's pseudo."
msgstr "Setiap pseudo-elemen thumb/track vendor memerlukan peraturan berasingan — menggabungkannya dalam satu senarai pemilih akan membatalkan keseluruhan peraturan dalam pelayar yang tidak mengenali pseudo vendor yang lain."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control is a native `<input type=\"range\">`; give it an accessible name with `aria-label` or an associated `<label>`."
msgstr "Kawalan ini adalah `<input type=\"range\">` asli; berikan nama yang boleh diakses dengan `aria-label` atau `<label>` yang berkaitan."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the value bubble's caret, a small triangle pointing back toward the track."
msgstr "Melukis caret pada gelembung nilai, sebuah segitiga kecil yang menunjuk kembali ke arah trek."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The typed numeric-entry counterpart."
msgstr "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — Padanan entri nombor yang ditaip."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: rating"
msgstr ""

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-rating` — A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "`.instui-rating` — Penilaian bintang dengan glif terisi dan kosong serta label nombor pilihan."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between star glyphs; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Menetapkan `gap` tersendiri di antara glif bintang; menautkan pengubah utiliti jarak `-gap-*` akan menggantikan nilai terbina tersebut."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give it role=\"img\" and an aria-label stating the rating, since the stars are icon glyphs."
msgstr "Berikan role=\"img\" dan aria-label yang menyatakan penarafan, kerana bintang itu adalah glif ikon."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render star glyphs with icon classes (for example, `-icon-star-solid`)."
msgstr "Papar glif bintang menggunakan kelas ikon (contohnya, `-icon-star-solid`)."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The numeric label, e.g. \"3/5\"."
msgstr "Label nombor, contohnya \"3/5\"."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: responsive"
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Kelas tunjuk/sembunyi berdasarkan lebar viewport atau kontena merentasi skala titik hentian bertema."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` hide by viewport width; `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` are the inverse (hidden by default, shown only inside the range via `display: revert`); the `-cq-` variants react to a `.instui-container` ancestor's width instead, not the viewport's. Scale tiers `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (sourced from the IR's tray-width component tokens) are each aliased to a long-form spelling (`x-small`–`x-large`) and a device name (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — both deprecated in favor of the short name — plus the unscaled, themed `content`/`content-full-width` tiers (the main content area's max-width)."
msgstr "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` sembunyikan mengikut lebar viewport; `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` adalah songsang (disembunyikan secara lalai, ditunjukkan hanya dalam julat melalui `display: revert`); variasi `-cq-` bertindak balas kepada lebar nenek moyang `.instui-container` sebaliknya, bukan lebar viewport. Tier skala `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (sumber daripada token komponen tray-width IR) masing-masing diwakili alias kepada ejaan bentuk panjang (`x-small`–`x-large`) dan nama peranti (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — kedua-duanya sudah lapuk demi nama pendek — serta tier bertema tak diskala `content`/`content-full-width` (lebar maksima kawasan kandungan utama)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts)"

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `content` breakpoint (`68.75em`)."
msgstr "Sembunyikan apabila kontena yang ditandakan berada pada atau di bawah titik hentian `content` (`68.75em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `content-full-width` breakpoint (`98.75em`)."
msgstr "Sembunyikan apabila kontena yang ditandakan berada pada atau di bawah titik hentian `content-full-width` (`98.75em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-xl`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-lg`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `lg` breakpoint (`48em`)."
msgstr "Sembunyikan apabila kontena yang ditandakan berada pada atau di bawah titik hentian `lg` (`48em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `md` breakpoint (`30em`)."
msgstr "Sembunyikan apabila kontena yang ditandakan berada pada atau di bawah titik hentian `md` (`30em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-md`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-xs`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-sm`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `sm` breakpoint (`20em`)."
msgstr "Sembunyikan apabila kontena yang ditandakan berada pada atau di bawah titik hentian `sm` (`20em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `xl` breakpoint (`62em`)."
msgstr "Sembunyikan apabila kontena yang ditandakan berada pada atau di bawah titik hentian `xl` (`62em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `xs` breakpoint (`16em`)."
msgstr "Sembunyikan apabila kontena yang ditandakan berada pada atau di bawah titik hentian `xs` (`16em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or above the `content` breakpoint (`68.75em`)."
msgstr "Sembunyikan apabila kontena yang ditandakan berada pada atau di atas titik hentian `content` (`68.75em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or above the `content-full-width` breakpoint (`98.75em`)."
msgstr "Sembunyikan apabila kontena yang ditandakan berada pada atau di atas titik hentian `content-full-width` (`98.75em`)."

