#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `content` breakpoint's value (`68.75em`, hand-authored, themed (not in the token IR)). Overriding it does not move the compiled `@media`/`@container` thresholds above."
msgstr "Nilai penanda hentian `content` (`68.75em`, ditulis tangan, bertema (bukan dalam token IR)). Menimpanya tidak menggerakkan ambang terkompil `@media`/`@container` ke atas."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `content-full-width` breakpoint's value (`98.75em`, hand-authored, themed (not in the token IR)). Overriding it does not move the compiled `@media`/`@container` thresholds above."
msgstr "Nilai penanda hentian `content-full-width` (`98.75em`, ditulis tangan, bertema (bukan dalam token IR)). Menimpanya tidak menggerakkan ambang terkompil `@media`/`@container` ke atas."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `lg` breakpoint's value (`48em`, mirrors `--instui-component-tray-width-lg`). Overriding it does not move the compiled `@media`/`@container` thresholds above."
msgstr "Nilai penanda hentian `lg` (`48em`, mencerminkan `--instui-component-tray-width-lg`). Menimpanya tidak menggerakkan ambang terkompil `@media`/`@container` ke atas."

#: css/responsive.md
