msgid "# CSS: table.body"
msgstr "# CSS: table.body"

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tbody` — The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "`tbody` — Kumpulan baris data jadual (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier restyles this member — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Pengubah suai `-layout-stacked` pada induk `table` menata semula ahli ini — lihat dokumen `table` sendiri untuk pengubah suai itu."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.cell"
msgstr "# CSS: table.cell"

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`td` — A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "`td` — Satu sel data (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier stacks this member as a block and labels it via `::before` — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Pengubah `-layout-stacked` pada induk `table` menyusun anggota ini sebagai blok dan melabelkannya melalui `::before` — lihat dokumentasi `table` sendiri untuk pengubah itu."

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.col-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.col-header"

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th` — A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "`th` — Sel pengepala lajur (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); gaya `th` lalai, ditimpa oleh `table.row-header` untuk `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.head"
msgstr "# CSS: table.head"

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`thead` — The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "`thead` — Kumpulan baris pengepala jadual (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier visually hides this member (its column titles surface per-cell instead) — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Modifier `-layout-stacked` pada induk `table` menyembunyikan ahli ini secara visual (tajuk lajurnya dipaparkan per-sel sebaliknya) — lihat dokumen `table` untuk modifier tersebut."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table"
msgstr ""

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-table` — A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-table` — Jadual data bergaya untuk `th` dan `td` serta kapsyen pilihan, dengan susun atur hover, tetap, dan kad bertindan."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For `-layout-stacked`, pure CSS can't pull each column header's text into its cell, so give every cell a `data-label` and the stacked card shows it via `::before`. See the `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, and `table.row-header` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Untuk `-layout-stacked`, CSS tulen tidak dapat menarik teks setiap pengepala lajur ke dalam selnya, jadi berikan setiap sel sebuah `data-label` dan kad bertindan memaparkannya melalui `::before`. Lihat ahli `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, dan `table.row-header` untuk bahagian individu."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the table with a `<caption>`, mark column headers `<th scope=\"col\">` and row headers `<th scope=\"row\">`, and in `-layout-stacked` give every cell a `data-label` since the header row is visually hidden."
msgstr "Labelkan jadual dengan `<caption>`, tandakan pengepala lajur sebagai `<th scope=\"col\">` dan pengepala baris sebagai `<th scope=\"row\">`, dan dalam `-layout-stacked` berikan setiap sel sebuah `data-label` kerana baris pengepala disembunyikan secara visual."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlight rows on hover. @affects table.row — Reserves and colours the row's hover border."
msgstr "Serlahkan baris ketika hover. @affects table.row — Menempah dan mewarnakan sempad hover baris."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed table layout (equal-width columns)."
msgstr "Susun atur jadual tetap (lajur lebar-sama)."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stack each row as a card, via a per-cell `data-label`. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Stacks each part as a block and hides/labels the header accordingly."
msgstr "Tindankan setiap baris sebagai kad, melalui `data-label` per-sel. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Menindankan setiap bahagian sebagai blok dan menyembunyikan/menandakan pengepala dengan sewajarnya."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An optional table caption."
msgstr "Kapsyen jadual pilihan."

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row-header"

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — Sel pengepala baris (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); digaya daripada token pengepala baris, bukan token pengepala lajur."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row"

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tr` — A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "`tr` — Satu baris jadual (InstUI `Table.Row`)."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-hover` and `-layout-stacked` modifiers restyle this member — see `table`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Induk `table` mempunyai pengubah `-hover` dan `-layout-stacked` yang menggayakan semula anggota ini — lihat dokumen `table` sendiri untuk pengubah tersebut."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tabs` — A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "`.instui-tabs` — Satu set panel ber-tab: senarai tab, tab yang boleh dipilih, dan panel mereka."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `tabs.tab` and `tabs.panel` members for the individual tab buttons and their content panels."
msgstr "Lihat ahli `tabs.tab` dan `tabs.panel` untuk butang tab individu dan panel kandungan mereka."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire the tab list with role=\"tablist\", each tab with role=\"tab\" and aria-selected, and each panel with role=\"tabpanel\"."
msgstr "Sambungkan senarai tab dengan role=\"tablist\", setiap tab dengan role=\"tab\" dan aria-selected, dan setiap panel dengan role=\"tabpanel\"."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the tab list on one line and let it scroll horizontally instead of wrapping, hiding the scrollbar."
msgstr "Pastikan senarai tab berada dalam satu baris dan biarkan ia menatal secara mendatar bukannya membungkus, menyembunyikan bar tatal."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rounded \"folder\" tabs with a selected tab that visually connects into the panel below. @affects tabs.tab — Restyles the tab buttons into the rounded \"folder\" look."
msgstr "Tab \"folder\" bulat dengan tab terpilih yang berhubung secara visual ke panel di bawah. @affects tabs.tab — Menggayakan semula butang tab kepada rupa \"folder\" bulat."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The row of tabs."
msgstr "Baris tab."

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.panel"
msgstr "# CSS: tabs.panel"

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.panel` — The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "`.panel` — Panel kandungan untuk tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.tab"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tab` — A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.tab` — Butang tab tunggal (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, dikonfigurasikan melalui senarai tab `Tabs` induk); `-selected` menandakan yang aktif."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary` modifier restyles this member into a rounded \"folder\" tab — see `tabs`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Pengubah `-variant-secondary` pada induk `tabs` menata semula ahli ini menjadi tab \"folder\" berbentuk bulat — lihat dokumen `tabs` untuk pengubah itu."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Non-interactive; same styling as `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."
msgstr "Bukan interaktif; gaya yang sama seperti `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active tab; same styling as `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "Tab aktif; gaya yang sama seperti `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tag"
msgstr ""

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tag` — An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "`.instui-tag` — Cip sebaris untuk kata kunci atau penapis."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Menetapkan `padding` mendatar sendiri (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` mengubah skala); merantai pemodifikasi utiliti selaian `-p-*`/`-padding-*` akan menggantikan nilai terbina itu."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Reads inline with text and gets a trailing dismiss glyph."
msgstr "Dibaca sebaris dengan teks dan mempunyai ikon tutup di hujung."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read-only (non-dismissable) tag."
msgstr "Tag baca sahaja (tidak boleh ditutup)."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Tag besar. Alias panjang bagi `-size-lg`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag."
msgstr "Tag besar."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag."
msgstr "Tag kecil."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Tag kecil. Alias panjang bagi `-size-sm`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the trailing dismiss glyph on a dismissible inline tag."
msgstr "Memaparkan ikon tutup di hujung pada tag sebaris yang boleh ditutup."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — The read-only label-chip counterpart."
msgstr "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — Rakan sepadan cip label baca sahaja."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: testimonial"
msgstr ""

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Paparan petikan atau testimoni dengan atribusi dan imej pilihan."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "✅ Gunakan Testimonial apabila:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying customer or user testimonials and quotes\n- You want to highlight a statement with visual emphasis\n- Attribution and context (name, title, image) are important\n🚫 Don't use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "- Memaparkan testimoni dan petikan pelanggan atau pengguna\n- Anda ingin menonjolkan kenyataan dengan penekanan visual\n- Atribusi dan konteks (nama, jawatan, imej) adalah penting\n🚫 Jangan gunakan Testimonial apabila:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying inline quotes in body text — use a blockquote element instead\n- The statement is the main focus — use Hero or Card instead"
msgstr "- Memaparkan petikan sebaris dalam teks badan — gunakan elemen blockquote sebaliknya\n- Kenyataan itu adalah fokus utama — gunakan Hero atau Card sebaliknya"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Use `<blockquote>` semantically for the quote\n- Ensure attribution is clear and associated with the quote\n- If using images, provide alt text"
msgstr "- Gunakan `<blockquote>` secara semantik untuk petikan\n- Pastikan atribusi jelas dan dikaitkan dengan petikan\n- Jika menggunakan imej, sediakan teks alt"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Attribution author name."
msgstr "Nama pengarang atribusi."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author profile image."
msgstr "Imej profil pengarang pilihan."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for quote and attribution."
msgstr "Kontena untuk petikan dan atribusi."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The quoted text."
msgstr "Teks yang dipetik."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author title or affiliation."
msgstr "Jawatan atau afiliasi pengarang pilihan."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-area"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-area` — A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "`.instui-text-area` — Sebuah `<textarea>` asli yang bergaya dan boleh diubah saiznya dengan keadaan dan saiz yang sama seperti input teks."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and focus states with `text-input` and `simple-select`; only `resize: vertical` and the taller minimum height are unique to it."
msgstr "Berkongsi sempadan, latar, dan keadaan fokusnya dengan `text-input` dan `simple-select`; hanya `resize: vertical` dan ketinggian minimum yang lebih tinggi yang unik kepadanya."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — The single-line counterpart with the same states and sizes."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Padanan satu baris dengan keadaan dan saiz yang sama."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-input` — A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "`.instui-text-input` — Satu `<input>` asli yang bergaya — termasuk `date`, `time`, dan `datetime-local`, di mana pelayar menyediakan pemilih — dengan keadaan pengesahan dan saiz."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and state chrome with `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input`, and `input-group`; for `date`/`time`/`datetime-local` types the browser supplies its own picker UI, which this stylesheet doesn't style."
msgstr "Berkongsi sempadan, latar dan chrome keadaan dengan `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input` dan `input-group`; untuk jenis `date`/`time`/`datetime-local` pelayar menyediakan UI pemilih sendiri, yang tidak diubah gaya oleh helaian gaya ini."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — The multi-line counterpart with the same states and sizes.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The numeric-entry input sharing this chrome.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — The native select sharing this field chrome.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Wraps this input with leading and trailing slots."
msgstr "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — Padanan berbilang baris dengan keadaan dan saiz yang sama.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — Kemasukan nombor yang berkongsi chrome ini.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — Pilihan asli yang berkongsi chrome medan ini.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Membungkus input ini dengan slot hadapan dan slot belakang."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text"
msgstr ""

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Tipografi teks badan dengan pengubah saiz, berat, warna, dan gaya."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets and the `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` modifiers all compose on the same element; unlike `heading`, it renders no implicit semantic level."
msgstr "Preset `-variant-*` dan pengubah `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` semuanya boleh digabungkan pada elemen yang sama; berbeza dengan `heading`, ia tidak merender tahap semantik tersirat."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text/text.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text/text.css)"

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-color-ai-highlight`."
msgstr ""

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AI-accent text colour with background highlight."
msgstr "Warna teks aksen AI dengan sorotan latar belakang."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Brand text colour."
msgstr "Warna teks jenama."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Danger text colour."
msgstr "Warna teks bahaya."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Primary text colour."
msgstr "Warna teks utama."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (primary inverse) text colour."
msgstr "Warna teks pada latar gelap (inverse utama)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Primary text colour on a coloured background."
msgstr "Warna teks utama pada latar berwarna."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary (muted) text colour."
msgstr "Warna teks sekunder (redupan)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (secondary inverse) text colour."
msgstr "Warna teks pada latar gelap (inverse sekunder)."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary text colour on a coloured background."
msgstr "Warna teks sekunder pada latar berwarna."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success text colour."
msgstr "Warna teks kejayaan."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
