#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-details"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-details` — A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-details` — Pendedahan native `<details>` yang bergaya dengan chevron berputar."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the native `<details>` element, so the browser drives open and close plus keyboard support; the CSS only hides the default marker and supplies the rotating chevron."
msgstr "Dibina pada elemen native `<details>`, jadi penyemak imbas mengawal buka dan tutup serta sokongan papan kekunci; CSS hanya menyembunyikan penanda lalai dan menyediakan chevron berputar."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the chevron after the summary."
msgstr "Letakkan chevron selepas ringkasan."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Filled (surface) variant."
msgstr "Varian berisi (permukaan)."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the disclosure is open."
msgstr "Melukis chevron pendedahan ringkasan, sebuah glif bertopeng yang berputar untuk menunjuk ke bawah apabila pendedahan dibuka."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — The bordered, grouped form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — Bentuk bersempadan dan berkumpulan bagi pendedahan yang sama."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-group` — A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-group` — Sebuah disclosure berbingkai dibina di atas `<details>`: bar ringkasan chevron dan kandungan yang boleh dikembangkan."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the same native `<details>` foundation as toggle-details; put the `<summary>` first so it becomes the clickable header row and the rest is the collapsible content."
msgstr "Dibina di atas asas native `<details>` yang sama seperti toggle-details; letakkan `<summary>` di hadapan supaya ia menjadi bar pengepala yang boleh diklik dan selebihnya ialah kandungan boleh dikembangkan."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary row's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the group is open."
msgstr "Melukis chevron disclosure bar ringkasan, glif bertopeng yang berputar untuk menunjuk ke bawah apabila kumpulan dibuka."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — The single, unbordered form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — Bentuk tunggal tanpa bingkai bagi disclosure yang sama."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tooltip"
msgstr ""

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tooltip` — A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "`.instui-tooltip` — Gelembung tooltip CSS untuk hover dan fokus, boleh ditempatkan di mana-mana sisi."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Toggling is pure CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), so the bubble only reaches keyboard users through a focusable trigger; unlike `popover`, it isn't dismissible or click-triggered."
msgstr "Pengalihan adalah CSS tulen (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), jadi gelembung hanya dapat dicapai oleh pengguna papan kekunci melalui pencetus yang boleh difokus; berbeza dengan `popover`, ia tidak boleh ditutup atau dicetuskan oleh klik."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Point the trigger at the bubble with aria-describedby and give the bubble role=\"tooltip\"."
msgstr "Arahkan pencetus ke gelembung dengan aria-describedby dan beri gelembung peranan=\"tooltip\"."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a trigger glyph icon next to the tooltip bubble."
msgstr "Paparkan ikon glyph pencetus di sebelah gelembung tooltip."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The bubble; `-placement-*` sets its side."
msgstr "Gelembung; `-placement-*` menetapkan sisinya."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The larger, click-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Permukaan berpaut yang lebih besar, dicetuskan oleh klik.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Permukaan berpaut berkaitan dengan penunjuk."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: transition"
msgstr ""

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Kelas keadaan animasi untuk komponen `Transition` — `.instui-transition` dan kelas keadaan (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, dsb.) — boleh digunakan sendiri atau disambung ke mana-mana komponen."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Transition type/state class toggled by runtime (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."
msgstr "Jenis peralihan/kelas keadaan yang ditogol oleh runtime (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation duration (default `300ms`); override to speed up or slow down every transition state."
msgstr "Tempoh animasi (lalai `300ms`); timpa untuk mempercepatkan atau memperlahankan setiap keadaan peralihan."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation timing function (default `ease-in-out`)."
msgstr "Fungsi masa animasi (lalai `ease-in-out`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tray` — An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "`.instui-tray` — Panel terpaku di tepi yang meluncur masuk dari mana-mana sisi; `[popover]` atau `<dialog>` asli."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start/end placements resolve against `inset-inline` (logical, direction-aware); the slide-in transform mirrors automatically under an ancestor `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, so no extra markup is needed for right-to-left layouts."
msgstr "Penempatan mula/akhir diselesaikan terhadap `inset-inline` (logik, peka arah); transformasi meluncur masuk dicerminkan secara automatik di bawah nenek moyang `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, jadi tiada markup tambahan diperlukan untuk susun atur kanan-ke-kiri."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The tray is a dialog or popover surface, so name it with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`, and its close control carries an `aria-label` (the `.instui-close-button` in the example uses `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."
msgstr "Tray adalah permukaan dialog atau popover, jadi namakan ia dengan `aria-label` atau `aria-labelledby`, dan kawalan tutupnya membawa `aria-label` ( `.instui-close-button` dalam contoh menggunakan `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the bottom edge."
msgstr "Pasang pada tepi bawah."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the end (inline-end) edge."
msgstr "Pasang pada tepi hujung (inline-end)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Pin to the start (inline-start) edge."
msgstr "(lalai) Pasang pada tepi permulaan (inline-start)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the top edge."
msgstr "Pasang pada tepi atas."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-size-md`."
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Opens with the native `[popover]` API and `@starting-style`; the slide-in sits behind an `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` guard, so browsers without it still open the tray, just without the slide."
msgstr "- Dibuka dengan API `[popover]` dan `@starting-style` asli; slide-in terletak di belakang pengawal `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)`, jadi pelayar tanpa sokongan itu masih membuka tray, cuma tanpa gelungan."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — The same dismissible overlay pattern, centred instead of edge-pinned.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer surface this builds on."
msgstr "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — Pola overlay boleh ditutup yang sama, dipusatkan bukannya dipasang pada tepi.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Permukaan lapisan atas generik yang menjadi asas bagi ini."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tree-browser"
msgstr ""

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tree-browser` — A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "`.instui-tree-browser` — Pokok pendedahan koleksi bersarang dan item daun, dengan chevron yang berputar."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each collection is a native `<details>`; nesting them inside one another builds the tree, and the browser handles opening and closing every branch."
msgstr "Setiap koleksi adalah `<details>` asli; menyarangkannya antara satu sama lain membina pokok, dan pelayar menguruskan pembukaan dan penutupan setiap cabang."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the root with role=\"tree\" and each nested list with role=\"group\"."
msgstr "Tandakan akar dengan role=\"tree\" dan setiap senarai bersarang dengan role=\"group\"."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render folder/file glyph icons in summaries and leaf items."
msgstr "Paparkan ikon glif folder/fail dalam ringkasan dan item daun."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A leaf entry in the tree."
msgstr "Satu entri daun dalam pokok."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws each collection's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the branch is open."
msgstr "Melukis chevron pendedahan setiap koleksi — sebuah glif bertopeng yang berputar untuk menunjuk ke bawah apabila cabang dibuka."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries."
msgstr "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Kedua-duanya mempersembahkan entri bertingkat yang boleh dipilih."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: truncate"
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--truncate` — Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "`.--truncate` — Pemendekan elipsis dengan penguncian baris dikawal oleh `--lines` — boleh digunakan sendiri atau digabungkan pada mana-mana komponen (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base class uses `display: -webkit-box` and reads the `--lines` custom property to clamp text to a fixed number of lines before it ends in an ellipsis."
msgstr "Kelas asas menggunakan `display: -webkit-box` dan membaca sifat tersuai `--lines` untuk mengehadkan teks kepada bilangan baris tetap sebelum ia berakhir dengan elipsis."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "JS Requirement"
msgstr "Keperluan JS"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component ships no CSS of its own — its markup and behavior come entirely from `@pantoken/interactions`. Its `--max-lines-auto` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "Komponen ini tidak menyertakan CSS sendiri — markup dan tingkah lakunya datang sepenuhnya dari `@pantoken/interactions`. Pengubah `--max-lines-auto` dikawal oleh tingkah laku itu. Lihat [jadual pengubah di bawah](#modifiers)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-1`."
msgstr "Alias bagi `--max-lines-1`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-2`."
msgstr "Alias bagi `--max-lines-2`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-3`."
msgstr "Alias bagi `--max-lines-3`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-4`."
msgstr "Alias bagi `--max-lines-4`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-5`."
msgstr "Alias bagi `--max-lines-5`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to one line (default)."
msgstr "Hadkan kepada satu baris (lalai)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to two lines."
msgstr "Hadkan kepada dua baris."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to three lines."
msgstr "Hadkan kepada tiga baris."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to four lines."
msgstr "Hadkan kepada empat baris."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to five lines."
msgstr "Hadkan kepada lima baris."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — — Clamp to the number of lines that fit in the container, based on its height and the line height of the text."
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Enables truncation and line clamping on the target element."
msgstr "Mengaktifkan pemendekan dan penguncian baris pada elemen sasaran."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Truncate at the character level."
msgstr "(lalai) Pendekkan pada peringkat aksara."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Truncate at the word level."
msgstr "Pendekkan pada peringkat perkataan."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Clamping relies on `-webkit-line-clamp` with `display: -webkit-box`, paired with the standard `line-clamp`."
msgstr "- Penguncian bergantung pada `-webkit-line-clamp` dengan `display: -webkit-box`, dipadankan dengan `line-clamp` standard."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography that this truncates."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Tipografi badan yang dipendekkan ini."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: two-column"
msgstr ""

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Susun atur dua lajur dengan kawasan kandungan kiri dan kanan."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "✅ Gunakan Two-Column apabila:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You have two content areas of roughly equal importance\n- Comparing or contrasting two sets of content side-by-side\n- Building a responsive layout that stacks on mobile\n🚫 Don't use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "- Anda mempunyai dua kawasan kandungan yang lebih kurang sama penting\n- Membandingkan atau membezakan dua set kandungan secara sebelah-menyebelah\n- Membina susun atur responsif yang tersusun bertindih pada peranti mudah alih\n🚫 Jangan gunakan Two-Column apabila:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- One column dominates the page — use asymmetric layout instead\n- Content doesn't benefit from side-by-side presentation"
msgstr "- Satu lajur menguasai halaman — gunakan susun atur tak simetri sebaliknya\n- Kandungan tidak mendapat manfaat daripada pembentangan sebelah-menyebelah"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure both columns are perceivable and usable on narrow viewports\n- Use semantic landmarks (e.g., `<section>`) to wrap column content\n- Maintain sufficient space and contrast between columns"
