#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: wrapper"
msgstr ""

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — Baris app-shell: navigasi sisi, bekas dengan pengepala, dan panel pilihan."

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "✅ Gunakan Wrapper apabila:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a full Canvas product page that needs a consistent layout shell\n- The page uses GlobalNav as the primary navigation anchor\n- The page needs side panels: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, or a UtilityPanel\n- You need consistent container padding and content max-width across the full page\n🚫 Don't use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "- Membangunkan halaman produk Canvas penuh yang memerlukan shell susun atur konsisten\n- Halaman menggunakan GlobalNav sebagai sauh navigasi utama\n- Halaman memerlukan panel sisi: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, atau UtilityPanel\n- Anda memerlukan padding bekas dan lebar maksimum kandungan yang konsisten di seluruh halaman\n🚫 Jangan gunakan Wrapper apabila:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a Modal, Tray, or Drawer — those have their own layout containers\n- Wrapping a sub-section of a page — Wrapper contains the full page, not a region"
msgstr "- Membangunkan Modal, Tray, atau Drawer — itu mempunyai bekas susun atur sendiri\n- Membalut subseksi halaman — Wrapper mengandungi seluruh halaman, bukan satu kawasan"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a &lt;main&gt; landmark with a skip-nav link so keyboard users can bypass GlobalNav\n- Give ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" with a distinct aria-label such as \"Page navigation\" — separate from GlobalNav's landmark\n- Give TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" with a descriptive aria-label that reflects its content, such as \"Student details\"\n- Give each UtilityPanel a distinct aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", or \"Filters\"\n- When a UtilityPanel opens, move focus into the panel; when it closes, return focus to the trigger that opened it"
msgstr "- Peta kawasan kandungan utama kepada penanda &lt;main&gt; dengan pautan skip-nav supaya pengguna papan kekunci boleh melepasi GlobalNav\n- Berikan ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" dengan aria-label yang berbeza seperti \"Page navigation\" — berasingan dari penanda GlobalNav\n- Berikan TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" dengan aria-label deskriptif yang mencerminkan kandungannya, seperti \"Student details\"\n- Berikan setiap UtilityPanel aria-label yang berbeza: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", atau \"Filters\"\n- Apabila UtilityPanel dibuka, pindahkan fokus ke dalam panel; apabila ia ditutup, kembalikan fokus kepada pencetus yang membukanya"

