#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/css` — emit Instructure design tokens as `@property`-typed CSS."
msgstr "`@pantoken/css` — mengeluarkan token reka bentuk Instructure sebagai CSS jenis `@property`."

#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[toCss](functions/toCss.md) turns any token IR into CSS; [css](variables/css.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` stylesheet and\n[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) is a lean variant that drops the full `--instui-icon-*` set (the ~1,777 icon data-URIs\nthat dominate the sheet) for CDN/embed delivery — ~a sixth the size over the wire. Both carry the\nelevation + focus-outline foundation (composite custom properties whose pure builders live in\n`@pantoken/utils`), so a component sheet resolves its shadows and focus ring against the token sheet\nalone. A DOM side-effect entry lives at `@pantoken/css/inject`; static files at\n`@pantoken/css/style.css` and `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."
msgstr "[toCss](functions/toCss.md) menukar mana‑mana IR token kepada CSS; [css](variables/css.md) ialah helaian gaya `rebrand` sedia guna dan\n[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) ialah varian ringan yang membuang set penuh `--instui-icon-*` (kira‑kira 1,777 data‑URI ikon\nyang mendominasi helaian) untuk penghantaran CDN/tersemat — kira‑kira seperenam saiznya melalui rangkaian. Kedua‑dua membawa asas\nelevation + focus‑outline (sifat tersuai komposit yang pembina tulennya tinggal di\n`@pantoken/utils`), jadi helaian komponen menyelesaikan bayang‑bayang dan cincin fokusnya terhadap helaian token sahaja. Entri kesan sisi DOM terletak pada `@pantoken/css/inject`; fail statik di\n`@pantoken/css/style.css` dan `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."

#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
