msgstr "# android"

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/android` — emit Instructure design tokens as Android resource XML."
msgstr "`@pantoken/android` — menghasilkan token reka bentuk Instructure sebagai XML sumber Android."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), then\nemits `res/values/colors.xml` (colour tokens) and `res/values/dimens.xml` (dimension tokens) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary applies the Android transforms (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."
msgstr "Ia meratakan IR kepada nilai konkrit, bermod tunggal (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), kemudian\nmenghasilkan `res/values/colors.xml` (token warna) dan `res/values/dimens.xml` (token dimensi) melalui\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary menerapkan transform Android (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."

