#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Default Value"
msgstr "#### Nilai lalai"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### onMissingInitialValue?"
msgstr "### onMissingInitialValue?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "What to do with an `@property` at-rule that has no `initial-value` descriptor."
msgstr "Apa yang perlu dilakukan terhadap at-rule `@property` yang tidak mempunyai deskriptor `initial-value`."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"remove\"` — drop the at-rule (default).\n- `\"keep\"` — leave it in the output untouched."
msgstr "- `\"remove\"` — buang at-rule itu (lalai).\n- `\"keep\"` — biarkan ia dalam output tanpa diubah."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: flattenProperty"
msgstr "# Pembolehubah: flattenProperty"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the flatten-`@property` PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Buat pemalam PostCSS flatten-`@property`."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Walks all `@property` at-rules in the stylesheet, extracts each `initial-value` descriptor, removes\nthe at-rule, and prepends a single `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` rule containing all\nextracted declarations. Empty rules and `@layer` blocks left behind after removal are dropped."
msgstr "Menelusuri semua at-rule `@property` dalam helaian gaya, mengekstrak setiap penerangan `initial-value`, membuang at-rule itu, dan menyisipkan satu peraturan `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` yang mengandungi semua deklarasi yang diekstrak.\nPeraturan kosong dan blok `@layer` yang tinggal selepas penghapusan dibuang."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Default injection into :root**"
msgstr "**Suntikan lalai ke dalam :root**"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inject into :scope (for use inside scope blocks)**"
msgstr "**Suntik ke dalam :scope (untuk digunakan di dalam blok skop)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# mangle-custom-props"
msgstr "# mangle-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names to minimal sequential\nidentifiers."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — menamakan semula nama sifat tersuai yang panjang kepada pengecam bersiri yang minimum\n."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-readable but expensive in\nminified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, every `var()` call,\nand every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name — across definitions,\n`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."
msgstr "Nama token seperti `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` boleh dibaca manusia tetapi mahal dalam\nbundel termampat: nama itu sendiri lebih 40+ bait, diulang dalam definisi, setiap panggilan `var()`,\ndan setiap pendaftaran `@property`. Plugin ini menggantikan setiap nama yang sepadan — merentasi definisi,\nrujukan `var()`, dan parameter `@property` — dengan pengecam minimum (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), mengurangkan overhead nama sebanyak ~90%."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a deterministic mapping,\nthen assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets multiple\nseparate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately processed CSS files that will\nbe loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."
msgstr "Nama dikumpulkan dari helaian gaya penuh, disusun mengikut abjad untuk pemetaan yang deterministik,\nkemudian diberikan secara bersiri. Pilihan [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) membenarkan beberapa\nlaluan PostCSS berasingan berkongsi satu pemetaan konsisten, jadi fail CSS yang diproses secara berasingan yang akan\ndimuatkan bersama boleh selamat dimampatkan dengan nama yang sama."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: MangleCustomPropsOptions"
msgstr "# Antaramuka: MangleCustomPropsOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Pilihan untuk [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."
msgstr "Hanya nama properti tersuai yang bermula dengan rentetan ini yang dimanipulasi."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### method?"
msgstr "### method?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."
msgstr "Algoritma yang digunakan untuk menjana nama pengganti pendek."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; shortest for large sets)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alphanumeric)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"
msgstr "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (lalai; paling pendek untuk set besar)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alfanumerik)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### propertyMap?"
msgstr "### propertyMap?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after processing.\nThe message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."
msgstr "Apabila `true`, menambahkan entri `mangle-map` ke PostCSS `result.messages` selepas pemprosesan.\nMesej tersebut berbentuk `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### sharedManifest?"
msgstr "### sharedManifest?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."
msgstr "Satu `Map` boleh ubah yang dikongsi merentasi berbilang laluan PostCSS."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) and writes new\nones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same `Map` instance to\nevery `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files which will be\nloaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical name mapping."
msgstr "Pada setiap laluan, plugin membaca entri sedia ada (menggunakan semula nama pendek mereka) dan menulis entri\nbaru (meneruskan pemasa dari `sharedManifest.size`). Serahkan instans `Map` yang sama kepada\nsetiap panggilan `mangleCustomProps` atau `applyMinify` yang memproses fail CSS yang akan\ndimuatkan bersama dalam pelayar — ini menjamin semua fail menggunakan peta nama yang sama."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest before the component\nsheets add their (typically overlapping) references."
msgstr "Proses helaian token terlebih dahulu supaya nama-namanya dimasukkan ke dalam manifest sebelum helaian\nkomponen menambah rujukan mereka (biasanya bertindih)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Type Alias: MangleMethod"
msgstr "# Alias Jenis: MangleMethod"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Strategi penjanaan nama pendek untuk [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: mangleCustomProps"
msgstr "# Pembolehubah: mangleCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Buat pemalam PostCSS mangle-custom-properties."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, `var()` references,\nand `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, deterministic mapping, then\nassigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence throughout the stylesheet."
msgstr "Mengumpulkan semua nama sifat tersuai yang sepadan dengan `prefix` dari props deklarasi, `var()` rujukan,\ndan parameter `@property`. Menyusunnya mengikut abjad untuk pemetaan yang stabil dan deterministik, kemudian\nmemberi nama pendek menggunakan `method` yang dipilih. Menggantikan setiap kejadian di seluruh helaian gaya."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"
msgstr "**Mangle dengan lalai (--instui-\\\\*, base26)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"
msgstr "**Kongsi pemetaan merentasi dua fail yang dimuatkan bersama**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Use base36 names and emit the mapping via result.messages**"
msgstr "**Gunakan nama base36 dan keluarkan pemetaan melalui result.messages**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: applyMinify()"
msgstr "# Fungsi: applyMinify()"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."
msgstr "Terapkan transformasi pemampatan custom-property kepada rentetan stylesheet."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. Plugin order:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the input unchanged when\nno options are set."
msgstr "Membina tatasusunan plugin PostCSS daripada `options` dan menjalankannya secara segerak. Susunan plugin:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Mengembalikan input tidak berubah apabila\ntiada pilihan ditetapkan."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stylesheet string to transform."
msgstr "Rentetan stylesheet untuk ditransformasikan."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transformed CSS string."
msgstr "Rentetan CSS yang telah ditransformasikan."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# props-minify"
msgstr "# props-minify"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — gabungkan transform pangkas, ratakan, dan mangle untuk\n`--instui-*` sifat tersuai melalui satu utiliti [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr "Setiap saluran yang menjana CSS (skrip penjanaan, renderer) menggunakan `applyMinify` untuk permukaan pemampatan yang konsisten tanpa bergantung terus kepada PostCSS."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr "**Prune + mangle hanya selamat untuk bundle tersendiri** di mana semua rujukan `var(--instui-*)`\ndan definisinya wujud dalam keluaran yang sama. Untuk pengguna fail berasingan (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` dimuat secara berasingan), gunakan hanya `{ flatten: true }`."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr "**Mangle merentas sempadan fail:** berikan contoh `Map` yang sama sebagai\n`mangle.sharedManifest` kepada setiap panggilan `applyMinify` yang memproses fail CSS yang dimuatkan bersama.\nProses helaian token dahulu (ia mengisi manifest), kemudian helaian komponen."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**Gunakan ketiga-tiga transform pada bundle tersendiri**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**Hanya ratakan (selamat untuk pengguna fail berasingan)**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"
msgstr "**Mangle dua fail dengan pemetaan yang sama**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: PropsMinifyOptions"
msgstr "# Antaramuka: PropsMinifyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."
msgstr "Pilihan untuk [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### prune?"
msgstr "### prune?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."
msgstr "Guna [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) untuk menyingkirkan token `--instui-*` yang tidak digunakan sebelum penukaran lain."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and the component\nrules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."
msgstr "Selamat hanya untuk bundel berdiri sendiri yang mengandungi kedua-dua definisi token dan peraturan komponen yang merujuknya. Memangkas helaian yang hanya mengandungi token akan membuang segala-galanya."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### flatten?"
msgstr "### flatten?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert `@property` at-rules to plain declarations."
msgstr "Guna [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) untuk menukar at-rules `@property` kepada perisytiharan biasa."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "`true` menggunakan nilai lalai pemalam (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nHantar objek [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) untuk menulis ganti nilai lalai secara individu."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### mangle?"
msgstr "### mangle?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long `--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."
msgstr "Guna [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) untuk menggantikan nama panjang `--instui-*` dengan pengecam yang ringkas."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nPass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override individual defaults — including\n`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."
msgstr "`true` menggunakan nilai lalai pemalam (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nHantar objek [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) untuk menulis ganti nilai lalai secara individu — termasuk\n`sharedManifest` untuk penyelarasan merentas fail."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."
msgstr "Selamat hanya untuk bundel berdiri sendiri. Lihat dokumentasi peringkat modul."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: pruneCustomProps"
msgstr "# Pembolehubah: pruneCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Buat plugin PostCSS prune-unused-custom-properties."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Run it as a standalone PostCSS pass**"
msgstr "**Jalankan ia sebagai laluan PostCSS berdiri sendiri**"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# prune-custom-props"
msgstr "# prune-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tree-shake unused custom properties from a composed\nstylesheet."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — menyingkirkan sifat tersuai yang tidak digunakan dari helaian gaya yang disusun."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "pantoken's `@pantoken/css` emits the whole `--instui-*` token set (≈1,800 icon data-URIs\nincluded). A renderer that builds on that layer but only styles a slice of the system would\notherwise ship the entire set — so any such renderer wants this. Starting from the `var()`\nreferences in real (non-custom-property) declarations, it transitively keeps only the custom\nproperties actually reachable, and drops the matching unused `@property` registrations."
msgstr "pantoken's `@pantoken/css` mengeluarkan keseluruhan set token `--instui-*` (≈1,800 data-URI ikon\ntermasuk). Perender yang dibina di atas lapisan itu tetapi hanya menggayakan sebahagian sistem sebaliknya\nakan menghantar keseluruhan set — jadi mana-mana perender sedemikian mahukan ini. Bermula dari rujukan `var()`\nDalam deklarasi sebenar (bukan sifat tersuai), ia secara transitif mengekalkan hanya sifat tersuai yang benar-benar\nboleh dicapai, dan membuang pendaftaran `@property` yang sepadan dan tidak digunakan."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It's a standalone PostCSS plugin (run it in your own PostCSS pipeline). The factory returns a\nplain plugin object, so importing this module pulls in no runtime dependency — `postcss` is only\na type."
msgstr "Ia adalah plugin PostCSS berdiri sendiri (jalankan dalam rangka PostCSS anda sendiri). Kilang mengembalikan objek\nplugin biasa, jadi mengimport modul ini tidak menarik sebarang pergantungan runtime — `postcss` hanyalah\nsebuah jenis."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"
msgstr "Menamakan semula dan mengeksport semula [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# theme-custom-media"
msgstr "# theme-custom-media"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — author with theme custom-idents\n(`@media (theme: <name>)`) and/or `@media (--theme-*)` aliases, then emit concrete CSS for a\nchosen target theme."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — author with theme custom-idents\n(`@media (theme: &lt;name&gt;)`) and/or `@media (--theme-*)` aliases, then emit concrete CSS for a\nchosen target theme."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin expands built-in `--theme-*` and `--breakpoint-*` aliases, prunes non-target theme\nbranches, strips matching `theme:*` clauses from kept queries, unwraps always-true theme-only media\nwrappers, and removes `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` declarations from emitted CSS."
msgstr "Plugin ini mengembangkan alias terbina dalam `--theme-*` dan `--breakpoint-*`, memangkas cawangan tema bukan sasaran\n, membuang klausa `theme:*` yang sepadan daripada pertanyaan yang disimpan, membuka pembalut media khusus tema yang sentiasa benar\n, dan mengalih keluar deklarasi `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` daripada CSS yang dihasilkan."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [themeCustomMedia](variables/themeCustomMedia.md)"
msgstr "Menamakan semula dan mengeksport semula [themeCustomMedia](variables/themeCustomMedia.md)"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: ThemeCustomMediaOptions"
msgstr "# Antaramuka: ThemeCustomMediaOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for the theme custom-media plugin."
msgstr "Pilihan untuk pemalam tema custom-media."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target theme to emit (default `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "Tema sasaran untuk dikeluarkan (lalai `\"rebrand\"`)."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/type-aliases/Theme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A theme the plugin can target when emitting concrete CSS."
msgstr "Tema yang boleh disasarkan oleh plugin ketika menjana CSS konkrit."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/variables/themeCustomMedia.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: themeCustomMedia"
msgstr "# Pembolehubah: themeCustomMedia"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/variables/themeCustomMedia.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the theme custom-media lowering plugin."
msgstr "Cipta pemalam untuk menurunkan custom-media tema."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/variables/themeCustomMedia.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Supports authoring with either direct theme custom-idents in media features (for example,\n`(theme: canvas)`) or built-in `@custom-media --theme-*` aliases."
msgstr "Menyokong pengarang dengan sama ada custom-idents tema terus dalam ciri media (contohnya,\n`(theme: canvas)`) atau alias `@custom-media --theme-*` terbina dalam."

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/load.md
