#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/rewriteComment.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: rewriteComment()"
msgstr "# Fungsi: rewriteComment()"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/rewriteComment.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Move every `@demo` block tag on a comment into `demo` fences appended to its summary, in order.\nBlock-tag content gets re-fenced by the markdown theme, so the fence must live in the summary\nprose, which is emitted verbatim."
msgstr "Pindahkan setiap tag blok `@demo` pada komen ke dalam pagar `demo` yang dilampirkan pada ringkasannya, mengikut susunan.\nKandungan tag blok akan digaris semula semula oleh tema markdown, jadi pagar mesti berada dalam\nprosa ringkasan, yang dihantar secara literal."

