#: renderers/css-in-js/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Works with any library that reads a theme from `props.theme` — Emotion, styled-components, and\nStitches all share that convention. [pantokenTheme](variables/pantokenTheme.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` object,\nvar()-backed so light/dark switching flows through `@pantoken/css`. [toStyledTheme](functions/toStyledTheme.md) builds\none from any IR (and can bake concrete values with `{ resolve }`)."
msgstr "Berfungsi dengan mana-mana perpustakaan yang membaca tema daripada `props.theme` — Emotion, styled-components, dan\nStitches semuanya berkongsi konvensyen itu. [pantokenTheme](variables/pantokenTheme.md) ialah objek `rebrand` siap guna,\ndisokong oleh var() supaya pertukaran terang/gelap mengalir melalui `@pantoken/css`. [toStyledTheme](functions/toStyledTheme.md) membina\nsatu daripada mana-mana IR (dan boleh menghasilkan nilai konkrit dengan `{ resolve }`)."

