msgid "`@pantoken/foundation` — theme Foundation for Sites with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — tema Foundation for Sites dengan token Instructure."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Foundation mengutamakan Sass, jadi pakej ini dihantar dalam dua lapisan. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) menghasilkan partial Sass gaya `_settings` yang mengarahkan pembolehubah tetapan Foundation kepada `var(--instui-*)`, jadi binaan Sass mengkompilkan rupa Instructure sambil mengekalkan theming masa jalan melalui sifat tersuai yang sama. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) menghasilkan overlay CSS nipis yang men-theme kelas terkompil biasa (`.button`, `.callout`, links) dengan cara yang sama — berguna apabila anda menggunakan CSS Foundation stok dan hanya mahu melapiskan warna Instructure di atas tanpa menyusun semula."

