msgid "Stylesheet URLs the runner injects (into its chrome and every rendered result): the component\nsheets, the multi-theme token sheet, and the plugin/surface sheets. The runner themes by toggling\nthe `data-pantoken-theme` attribute, so one token sheet covers every theme."
msgstr "URL helaian gaya yang disuntikkan oleh runner (ke dalam chrome dan setiap hasil yang dirender): helaian komponen, helaian token pelbagai tema, dan helaian plugin/surface. Runner menukar tema dengan menogol atribut `data-pantoken-theme`, jadi satu helaian token merangkumi setiap tema."

